{"id":"38360700-8440-454c-8995-f4a145b1875e","expr":"target.equals(target.trim())","rationale":"Typically, processing instruction targets do not have leading or trailing whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#processingInstructionInternal(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:31:27.384562995Z"}
