{"id":"cfcb14b6-b922-4460-a4cb-850e925754c3","expr":"len >= 0","rationale":"Length to read from the array must be non-negative","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCharacters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:53.130825533Z"}
{"id":"b13ee0ae-454f-4247-8301-1d9cc3adfc6b","expr":"(start + len) <= text.length","rationale":"The substring defined by start and len must fit within the text array","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCharacters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:53.130825533Z"}
{"id":"d3bf41d5-7b1f-4141-911e-ef6b6f211611","expr":"text != null","rationale":"The 'text' parameter must be non-null since it is passed to createCharacters which expects a non-null argument.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCharacters(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:55.000035285Z"}
{"id":"59b8d17f-21b0-4508-b9b0-a90e346cb7c2","expr":"text.length() >= 0","rationale":"The length of the text string is always >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCharacters(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:55.000035285Z"}
{"id":"bdc88b58-9105-4ee9-b588-ee3dd2c40c51","expr":"!text.isEmpty() || text.length() == 0","rationale":"This invariant is a tautology for demonstrating text emptiness condition; it essentially states text is empty or not.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCharacters(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:55.000035285Z"}
{"id":"6ace536a-4776-4edf-81ea-b32333f88e44","expr":"data != null","rationale":"The method creates a CDATA event with data; data should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCData(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:56.104087749Z"}
{"id":"04b03c85-e9c3-4b21-8045-7f6b66f704e9","expr":"data.length() >= 0","rationale":"Ensures data has a valid length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCData(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:56.104087749Z"}
{"id":"f0237ad4-826d-42f3-ad63-7e101c6f75d9","expr":"data.equals(data)","rationale":"This is trivial and always true; could be excluded.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCData(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:56.104087749Z"}
{"id":"07b4aa90-3571-4e13-91dc-05e90727da73","expr":"data.trim().length() >= 0","rationale":"Trimmed data length cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCData(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:56.104087749Z"}
{"id":"ec321b47-1584-422b-b35f-7f83ee6dbb1c","expr":"text != null","rationale":"The method creates a new String from the char array text using start and len, so text must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCharacters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:57.020942521Z"}
{"id":"c8ca7231-74bb-4f0e-b23c-850ca4c10833","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"start index should be non-negative as it is used in new String(text, start, len).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCharacters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:57.020942521Z"}
{"id":"13153d37-9131-4cf5-8322-6bc50afdc376","expr":"len >= 0","rationale":"len should be non-negative length passed to String constructor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCharacters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:57.020942521Z"}
{"id":"38de0362-e5c7-43dc-9529-bc348d6e5f1e","expr":"start + len <= text.length","rationale":"start + len must not exceed text.length for the substring constructor to be valid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCharacters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:57.020942521Z"}
{"id":"d27d34e3-f913-4bae-a6c1-dc8b7d2592c4","expr":"data != null","rationale":"Data parameter is passed to createCData and is likely non-null at this point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCData(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:57.135060397Z"}
{"id":"304385d6-fb40-42b6-b0d8-b263b86123f7","expr":"data.length() >= 0","rationale":"String length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCData(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:57.135060397Z"}
{"id":"906a0bb9-a16c-4ed3-8b78-0490bd861ccf","expr":"!(data.contains(\"]]>\"))","rationale":"CDATA sections cannot include the sequence ]]> inside the data.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCData(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:57.135060397Z"}
{"id":"df8614f8-d0f2-4cc4-a0a3-47b03829f5a3","expr":"data.indexOf('<') == -1 || data.indexOf('>') != -1","rationale":"Data may contain XML markups either none or well-formed tags.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCData(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:57.135060397Z"}
{"id":"df6d80dd-063e-489c-a2d0-c897b53c11ad","expr":"data != null","rationale":"The method uses data to create a comment, which requires data not to be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeComment(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:59.207129655Z"}
{"id":"d42b9681-7aea-4310-aa12-9f93308c254c","expr":"!data.contains(\"--\")","rationale":"An XML comment cannot contain the substring '--', so data should not contain it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeComment(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:59.207129655Z"}
{"id":"81318a04-958f-40ee-bcc3-161e1ccc4d89","expr":"data.indexOf('>') == -1 || data.indexOf('>') < data.length() - 1","rationale":"Typically XML comments don't abruptly end with '>' as it can complicate parsing. This invariant is a loose safe condition.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeComment(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:59.207129655Z"}
{"id":"147b2148-68b6-4d88-a59a-e9d468af8cc8","expr":"data.length() >= 0","rationale":"String length is always non-negative, a trivial but valid invariant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeComment(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:59.207129655Z"}
{"id":"2f928056-1e8f-4ab6-b775-e8a44ad79426","expr":"data != \"--\"","rationale":"The data should not be exactly \"--\" as this is illegal in XML comments.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeComment(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:32:59.207129655Z"}
{"id":"ab483228-c26f-4bf5-8938-c445ca8040f9","expr":"data == null || (data.indexOf(\"--\") == -1 && !data.endsWith(\"-\"))","rationale":"This invariant reflects that the comment data passed is valid according to XML comment rules, which disallow double hyphens and comments ending with a hyphen.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeComment(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:00.710676743Z"}
{"id":"dfeb0a54-733a-41d0-99b6-cdddbc5a9d31","expr":"data == null || data.length() >= 0","rationale":"Basic length property of the String data parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeComment(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:00.710676743Z"}
{"id":"2156cc20-0995-4e60-94ae-0544286d5952","expr":"data == null || data.trim().length() >= 0","rationale":"Reflects string trimming property.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeComment(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:00.710676743Z"}
{"id":"597e829c-33cc-482c-b982-b9d9230a6054","expr":"target != null","rationale":"writeProcessingInstruction creates a processing instruction event with the given target; target should be non-null to represent a valid instruction name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:01.404273752Z"}
{"id":"c799ce31-4142-4cbb-8318-c21aa34b6968","expr":"!target.isEmpty()","rationale":"Meaningful processing instructions must have a non-empty target; empty target would be invalid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:01.404273752Z"}
{"id":"b8dc3dd5-13b8-439b-84fe-047de33822d8","expr":"target.indexOf(' ') == -1","rationale":"Target is used as the processing instruction name which typically has no spaces.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:01.404273752Z"}
{"id":"34d37aa7-1a52-455d-94e1-c1b0b90917e5","expr":"target.indexOf('?') == -1","rationale":"The ? character is reserved in processing instructions and should not appear in the target.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:01.404273752Z"}
{"id":"7304aa86-1925-47ec-8055-e29e78f9aa6c","expr":"target.equals(target.trim())","rationale":"Leading or trailing whitespace in target would be non-standard and likely disallowed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:01.404273752Z"}
{"id":"f12cee3e-698f-4e33-80ce-84116c119299","expr":"target != null","rationale":"The target parameter should never be null when writing a processing instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:02.923721807Z"}
{"id":"7b4171ad-1dfc-44c1-b3de-6ef6cdd3e3fa","expr":"target.length() > 0","rationale":"A processing instruction target is expected to be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:02.923721807Z"}
{"id":"d94a78ad-60da-4f0f-9986-a711c1ea8a6b","expr":"data == null || data.length() >= 0","rationale":"Data parameter may be null or a string of any length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:02.923721807Z"}
{"id":"6f76a7cf-3e16-4406-a4a2-8ee129203ac5","expr":"target.indexOf(' ') == -1","rationale":"XML processing instruction targets do not contain whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:02.923721807Z"}
{"id":"ab4acbee-80bc-4c6c-b059-0ad86aa79c8a","expr":"(data == null) || (!data.contains(\"?>\"))","rationale":"Data string must not contain the sequence that ends the processing instruction prematurely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:02.923721807Z"}
{"id":"2930a3cc-66d0-4a1e-8f23-383310fea138","expr":"localName != null","rationale":"The XML attribute localName should not be null when writing an attribute.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeAttribute(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:04.447182147Z"}
{"id":"e50259ff-f34d-41be-9d89-6b069b3135ef","expr":"value != null","rationale":"The XML attribute value is expected to be non-null even if empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeAttribute(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:04.447182147Z"}
{"id":"73f72764-7b3e-43d9-81c1-50eaabd51fa6","expr":"localName.length() > 0","rationale":"localName should be a non-empty string representing the attribute name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeAttribute(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:04.447182147Z"}
{"id":"bcd11bca-9dc1-4ed1-a3c4-aa77bc6f660c","expr":"value.length() >= 0","rationale":"Value length should be at least zero since empty string is allowed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeAttribute(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:04.447182147Z"}
{"id":"2dccceb9-5d6e-48bf-a67f-5416a8e11344","expr":"target != null","rationale":"The 'target' parameter for a processing instruction is expected to be non-null as per XML processing requirements.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:05.077497599Z"}
{"id":"798a5f71-53ea-415c-b095-dd766678141b","expr":"data == null || !data.contains(\"?>\")","rationale":"The 'data' string cannot contain the sequence '?>' as it would prematurely close the processing instruction in XML.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:05.077497599Z"}
{"id":"189797d9-350f-4630-91ae-aa771bfcdd79","expr":"target.length() > 0","rationale":"The 'target' of a processing instruction is expected to be a non-empty string as per XML specs.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:05.077497599Z"}
{"id":"3592dcfa-f07c-4137-af94-4a8e51e87ce9","expr":"data == null || data.length() >= 0","rationale":"The 'data' parameter can be null or any string including empty, but it must be safe to call length() if not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:05.077497599Z"}
{"id":"ea322aa0-bd2a-415f-aab6-9f09a553a1b7","expr":"target != null || data == null","rationale":"It would be logically consistent that if 'target' is null (though unlikely), 'data' must also be null to avoid partial or invalid instructions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:05.077497599Z"}
{"id":"22ddc256-6beb-4a0c-8c41-39e9f31ba98a","expr":"dtd != null && !dtd.isEmpty()","rationale":"The dtd string should typically be non-null and not empty when writing a DTD.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeDTD(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:05.097541307Z"}
{"id":"4b0c3969-33bf-4cf7-b0bd-d100bef07d64","expr":"dtd == null || dtd.trim().length() > 0","rationale":"If dtd is null, no invariant about length applies; otherwise, the trimmed dtd should have length > 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeDTD(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:05.097541307Z"}
{"id":"0a3c7aa9-0529-42db-806b-749a0b1f0a8e","expr":"dtd == null || dtd.indexOf('<') >= 0","rationale":"A valid DTD string often contains '<' characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeDTD(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:05.097541307Z"}
{"id":"79095634-6aaa-447f-94fe-1232749a539b","expr":"dtd == null || (dtd.indexOf('[') < 0 || dtd.indexOf(']') >= dtd.indexOf('['))","rationale":"The dtd string, if containing brackets, should have closing bracket after opening bracket.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeDTD(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:05.097541307Z"}
{"id":"efe55d14-126f-4d33-b334-51faba021df2","expr":"dtd == null || dtd.length() <= 10000","rationale":"The dtd string length is reasonably bounded for typical usage.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeDTD(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:05.097541307Z"}
{"id":"c28cc585-ba15-418a-b353-3af9f4b9cf54","expr":"dtd != null","rationale":"The method creates a DTD event with dtd string, so string should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeDTD(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:05.617879251Z"}
{"id":"4a931033-a9d6-4ed7-91e9-cc0705a02c26","expr":"dtd.length() > 0","rationale":"The DTD string should have some length to produce a meaningful DTD event.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeDTD(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:05.617879251Z"}
{"id":"e243457b-db8e-44cb-9fcb-71476d317dc6","expr":"!dtd.contains(\"<\") && !dtd.contains(\">\")","rationale":"The DTD string typically does not contain raw XML elements < and >, it should be a declaration string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeDTD(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:05.617879251Z"}
{"id":"e36543b4-b56d-46be-9369-f8905d5f6f53","expr":"dtd.equals(dtd.trim())","rationale":"The DTD string is likely trimmed since used directly in event creation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeDTD(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:05.617879251Z"}
{"id":"a4492bc8-9394-47dd-bc9f-2374ce4c80b8","expr":"localName != null","rationale":"The localName must be non-null to construct a QName object used in createAttribute.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeAttribute(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:06.734705774Z"}
{"id":"cbcdddaa-424d-417e-a346-4f5201d55403","expr":"value != null","rationale":"Value passed as the attribute value must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeAttribute(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:06.734705774Z"}
{"id":"0bc7ce0c-73c4-43ef-8d01-f61d9bab3065","expr":"namespaceURI == null || !namespaceURI.isEmpty()","rationale":"Namespace URI is either null or non-empty to be valid for QName creation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeAttribute(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:06.734705774Z"}
{"id":"1d173581-7c85-4585-8996-e51734b01ca0","expr":"(namespaceURI == null || namespaceURI.length() > 0) && localName.length() > 0","rationale":"localName length positive and namespaceURI either null or has positive length for QName creation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeAttribute(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:06.734705774Z"}
