{"id":"59cea8f7-43e4-4f81-bb19-94c27609aafe","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"The entity name is likely a non-empty string to identify the entity properly for the XML processing.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#endEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:33:29.044250855Z"}
