{"id":"1b1c1d85-8831-4395-80d3-774bf2fb9131","expr":"systemId != null && !systemId.isEmpty()","rationale":"systemId is always appended to the DOCTYPE declaration and thus must be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:34:24.863666434Z"}
{"id":"f9dc36e0-ed10-4d88-b86e-6e699dbfff3b","expr":"(publicId == null) || (!publicId.isEmpty())","rationale":"publicId is optionally appended; if non-null it is appended as PUBLIC identifier with quotes, so it is expected to be a non-empty string if not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:34:24.863666434Z"}
