{"id":"57ba7455-89dd-41bf-b069-b529d4ce2251","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The startEntity method is likely called with a valid entity name; null is not expected.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:34:27.787019478Z"}
{"id":"e5cb632b-012d-4714-9283-daba3afafc47","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"Entity names typically have length greater than zero to identify an entity.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:34:27.787019478Z"}
