{"id":"f485532c-3c49-47d1-92a0-565a88a20955","expr":"qName.getLocalPart() != null","rationale":"QName's local part is expected to be a non-null String.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#isNamespaceDeclaration(QName):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:34:32.099536805Z"}
{"id":"cae7aa03-9971-40c3-980b-6baf608d0f42","expr":"(qName.getLocalPart().isEmpty() && !qName.getPrefix().isEmpty()) == false","rationale":"If localPart is empty, prefix should be empty to possibly be a namespace declaration, per method logic.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#isNamespaceDeclaration(QName):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:34:32.099536805Z"}
{"id":"1994afa3-8f3c-430a-9117-f652ea3f83dc","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a new QName instance when called.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:34:33.211431429Z"}
{"id":"554bd1ee-3da7-4dff-92a0-a97160a19123","expr":"qualifiedName.indexOf(':') == -1 && result.getNamespaceURI().equals(namespaceUri) && result.getLocalPart().equals(qualifiedName) && (result.getPrefix() == null || result.getPrefix().isEmpty())","rationale":"In the no-colon case, the QName should have the passed namespaceUri, localPart == qualifiedName, and empty prefix.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:34:33.211431429Z"}
{"id":"27cb890a-6fdf-44ed-b579-27c4a4c83fe9","expr":"result.getNamespaceURI() == namespaceUri || (namespaceUri != null && namespaceUri.equals(result.getNamespaceURI()))","rationale":"The QName returned always has the namespace URI equal to the namespaceUri parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:34:33.211431429Z"}
{"id":"af4f8466-4091-495c-96ee-651fd36caac5","expr":"result.getLocalPart() != null && !result.getLocalPart().isEmpty()","rationale":"Local part is always derived from qualifiedName and thus should be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#toQName(String,String):QName","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:34:33.211431429Z"}
{"id":"26c4d02c-aebd-4477-b2b0-2c83fda1e247","expr":"!result || (qName.getPrefix() != null && qName.getLocalPart() != null)","rationale":"If result is true, prefix and localPart must be non-null to satisfy condition safely.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#isNamespaceDeclaration(QName):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:34:33.223741816Z"}
