{"id":"adfc52b7-b624-4c38-970e-41267ecd88cf","expr":"!result","rationale":"The method either returns false or throws. Whenever it returns, result is false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLReader#getFeature(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:34:47.933618687Z"}
