{"id":"88c07099-9a43-4c93-8721-739de19f685e","expr":"(className.indexOf('.') >= 0) == (result.indexOf('/') >= 0)","rationale":"If className contains dots, result should contain slashes, and vice versa.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#convertClassNameToResourcePath(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:42:32.223419644Z"}
{"id":"9102e03e-1d2a-4af5-8739-eb6cf4231011","expr":"result.length() == className.length()","rationale":"Replacing dots with slashes does not change string length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#convertClassNameToResourcePath(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:42:32.223419644Z"}
{"id":"33bf10a7-04b7-4d08-b914-7609678e7857","expr":"resourceName != null","rationale":"resourceName must not be null as enforced by the Assert.notNull call in the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#addResourcePathToPackagePath(Class<?>,String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:42:35.955864581Z"}
{"id":"acc52c58-2f15-41c8-b063-4c3ef71bf0f6","expr":"(!resourceName.startsWith(\"/\") || resourceName.startsWith(\"/\"))","rationale":"Logical tautology showing that resourceName either starts with '/' or it doesn't.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#addResourcePathToPackagePath(Class<?>,String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:42:35.955864581Z"}
{"id":"853cad14-72a0-40af-8574-bee52a3185af","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"clazz is expected to be non-null in most usage since it represents a Class object to derive package path.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#addResourcePathToPackagePath(Class<?>,String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:42:35.955864581Z"}
{"id":"46d21b0f-30ea-4f53-aa78-76eb88265e89","expr":"resourceName.length() > 0","rationale":"resourceName must contain at least one character since it is used in startsWith call and resource concatenation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#addResourcePathToPackagePath(Class<?>,String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:42:35.955864581Z"}
{"id":"57c0685f-92a9-41c1-a623-cec9c25ca117","expr":"clazz == null || clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"The method uses clazz.getName() only if clazz is not null, implying that clazz's getName() must be non-null if clazz exists.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#classPackageAsResourcePath(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:42:36.961404705Z"}
{"id":"c7c8dd60-7333-4b1b-88f2-453f0ebb7274","expr":"clazz == null || clazz.getName().indexOf('.') >= -1","rationale":"The lastIndexOf for PACKAGE_SEPARATOR searches for '.' which can be -1 if not found, so indexOf('.') returns at least -1.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#classPackageAsResourcePath(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:42:36.961404705Z"}
{"id":"5fbb3d97-5dc8-471a-bbd0-b1d6bebcee66","expr":"clazz == null || clazz.getName().lastIndexOf('.') >= -1","rationale":"The lastIndexOf call on className can return -1 if PACKAGE_SEPARATOR is not present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#classPackageAsResourcePath(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:42:36.961404705Z"}
{"id":"ec89eec4-8b7b-4cb8-9337-39c16ff12a01","expr":"clazz == null || clazz.getName().lastIndexOf('.') <= clazz.getName().length() - 1","rationale":"The lastIndexOf result must be within the bounds of the string indices.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#classPackageAsResourcePath(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:42:36.961404705Z"}
{"id":"a21e1379-9936-4a94-8468-29199d726ca1","expr":"clazz == null || clazz.getName().contains(\".\") || clazz.getName().lastIndexOf('.') == -1","rationale":"The lastIndexOf returns -1 only when the string does not contain the character. Thus, lastIndexOf('.') == -1 means no dot is present in name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#classPackageAsResourcePath(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:42:36.961404705Z"}
{"id":"1769b12e-71ff-42d0-81b6-2aef2a46d4e3","expr":"result.indexOf(\"//\") == -1","rationale":"Since PATH_SEPARATOR is appended only once and resourceName is concatenated carefully, result should not contain \"//\".","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#addResourcePathToPackagePath(Class<?>,String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:42:37.517803705Z"}
{"id":"fa6ada7f-e042-42bf-bfb7-c084cae1ef10","expr":"!result.startsWith(\"/\")","rationale":"The method constructs resource path starting from package path (no leading slash) plus resourceName, but only resourceName may start with /, which is appended after the package path which doesn't start with /, so the result doesn't start with a slash.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#addResourcePathToPackagePath(Class<?>,String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:42:37.517803705Z"}
