{"id":"7d1eef17-b0ad-4968-a7b6-fe7e20137299","expr":"collection == null || collection.isEmpty() || collection.size() >= 0","rationale":"A Java Collection's size is always non-negative, so if collection is not empty, size() >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#toClassArray(Collection<Class<?>>):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:42:45.638002801Z"}
