{"id":"042cd6e7-0c44-417b-849a-269edb5e9d03","expr":"result.length == (collection != null ? collection.size() : 0)","rationale":"The returned array length equals the size of the input collection or zero if collection is null or empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#toClassArray(Collection<Class<?>>):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:42:49.863550903Z"}
