{"id":"80e86794-7ee7-4154-b12d-ff935f0e1f2b","expr":"instance.getClass().getInterfaces().length >= 0","rationale":"A class's getInterfaces() returns an array; length is always zero or more.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesAsSet(Object):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:42:57.875773047Z"}
