{"id":"40127388-877c-4992-bef5-2d113c7bc6ef","expr":"result.getClassLoader() == classLoader || (result.getClassLoader() != null && classLoader == null)","rationale":"The result's classLoader matches the given classLoader or is non-null if classLoader given is null (system classloader fallback).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#createCompositeInterface(Class<?>[],ClassLoader):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:43:08.598302898Z"}
{"id":"725a29a9-feac-4317-b7b2-04ea9ffd3680","expr":"clazz1 != null || clazz2 != null","rationale":"At least one class is non-null because the method returns one if the other is null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#determineCommonAncestor(Class<?>,Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:43:09.977261214Z"}
{"id":"1cc1df17-eb82-4a5a-a2e4-48ce1053ef98","expr":"clazz1 == null || clazz1.isAssignableFrom(clazz2) || clazz2 == null || clazz2.isAssignableFrom(clazz1) || clazz1.getSuperclass() != null","rationale":"Because if neither is assignable from the other and both non-null, clazz1 must have a superclass to find common ancestor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#determineCommonAncestor(Class<?>,Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:43:09.977261214Z"}
{"id":"5cf69b21-a90b-4eef-a132-204686810f94","expr":"clazz1 == null || clazz2 == null || clazz1 != clazz2","rationale":"The method returns the first class if it is assignable from the second, so they are likely different instances or one is a superclass.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#determineCommonAncestor(Class<?>,Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:43:09.977261214Z"}
{"id":"0e1cbb87-946a-4985-a67f-cfae081df9ba","expr":"clazz1 != null && clazz2 != null || clazz1 == null || clazz2 == null","rationale":"Precisely reflects that at most one is null, or both are non-null, covering method preconditions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#determineCommonAncestor(Class<?>,Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:43:09.977261214Z"}
