{"id":"326f3a1e-0941-419c-9358-140a9554131d","expr":"result == null || result.isAssignableFrom(clazz1)","rationale":"If result is not null, it must be a superclass or superinterface of clazz1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#determineCommonAncestor(Class<?>,Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:43:13.012407599Z"}
