{"id":"da9f5720-ae37-4ca5-a6c9-687d2e90377d","expr":"targetMethod == null || !targetMethod.isEmpty()","rationale":"If targetMethod is set, it should not be an empty string as method names must contain characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.MethodInvoker#setTargetMethod(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/MethodInvoker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:46:49.834835581Z"}
