{"id":"c70a12a3-af78-4a8c-8e37-74dc839b2384","expr":"offset >= 0","rationale":"From the method implementation, an IndexOutOfBoundsException is thrown if offset < 0, so at exit offset must be >= 0","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.FastByteArrayOutputStream#write(byte[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/FastByteArrayOutputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:46:53.625418795Z"}
