{"id":"96cecfce-82d4-4107-a8a9-74d1169e2fd8","expr":"offset + length <= data.length","rationale":"The method throws if offset + length > data.length, ensuring that the range accessed is valid","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.FastByteArrayOutputStream#write(byte[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/FastByteArrayOutputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:46:53.625418795Z"}
{"id":"373eef79-fc9f-407d-9f34-ee2b5391517d","expr":"data != null","rationale":"The data array must not be null for System.arraycopy to succeed","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.FastByteArrayOutputStream#write(byte[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/FastByteArrayOutputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:46:53.625418795Z"}
