{"id":"8c44217e-ab41-4881-af0c-37ea92e04d85","expr":"buffer != null","rationale":"The method appends a character to buffer, so buffer must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.DefaultToStringStyler#styleEnd(StringBuilder,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/core/style/DefaultToStringStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:08.795684678Z"}
