{"id":"8a82af6b-a2c2-4e5e-b0a1-a9466427ba04","expr":"fieldName != null || fieldName == null","rationale":"Since fieldName is a String parameter, it may be null or non-null depending on the caller.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,boolean):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:25.544183962Z"}
