{"id":"daed0c7a-6f2f-4167-94c7-6001cc19e294","expr":"value == true || value == false","rationale":"value is a primitive boolean, so it only holds true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,boolean):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:25.544183962Z"}
{"id":"191856a3-c0d8-4dfc-a5e6-8c74d4e56b19","expr":"fieldName == null || fieldName.isEmpty() == false","rationale":"A common invariant: if fieldName is non-null, often it is non-empty when used as a field name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,boolean):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:25.544183962Z"}
{"id":"b39b2b67-09c6-41fd-a003-d9f48f5a187c","expr":"fieldName != null","rationale":"Typically, fieldName representing a field's name is non-null in toString implementations.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,double):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:28.109057594Z"}
{"id":"01730ad6-79a8-48fa-80f3-a7da1e2fb4b4","expr":"Double.isFinite(value) || !Double.isFinite(value)","rationale":"The double value may be any double value, finite or infinite.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,double):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:28.109057594Z"}
{"id":"55d5afbb-d379-4407-b97f-39157ffa97b0","expr":"fieldName.length() >= 0","rationale":"String length is always 0 or more; this satisfies a property of fieldName.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,double):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:28.109057594Z"}
{"id":"1991041d-fa22-4c41-9a5d-cceea6e6c1dc","expr":"result != null","rationale":"'result' is the object returned by the method which is 'this', so it cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,Object):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:29.234557861Z"}
{"id":"5a9a8e8f-51e0-4638-8bb8-431a3b02f529","expr":"result.toString().contains(fieldName)","rationale":"The resulting string representation typically contains the appended field name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,Object):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:29.234557861Z"}
{"id":"21adffe9-6baa-4483-957d-8994348e0c91","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the append method returns 'this' (the ToStringCreator instance), result should always be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,boolean):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:29.284644811Z"}
{"id":"445b856a-db1f-4f8e-9df9-b7e1e6c641e3","expr":"result.toString().contains(fieldName) || fieldName == null","rationale":"Append method adds the field 'fieldName' to the ToStringCreator's internal buffer, so it should reflect in toString.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,boolean):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:29.284644811Z"}
{"id":"2a18ddb0-94bd-454a-b4b8-cfb11d4f3140","expr":"fieldName != null","rationale":"In ToStringCreator, fieldName usually represents the field's name and should not be null to ensure proper formatting.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,Object):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:29.620527747Z"}
{"id":"ad53d542-8c53-4222-a0e9-f62b8bfa3560","expr":"value == null || !fieldName.isEmpty()","rationale":"Ensures that if a value is appended, the fieldName is meaningful and not empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,Object):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:29.620527747Z"}
{"id":"faca199c-db2c-40aa-bcaf-440302f7e8ca","expr":"value == null || value.toString() != null","rationale":"ToStringCreator relies on toString of the value; it should not return null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,Object):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:29.620527747Z"}
{"id":"b6f57b97-cbe7-4957-b535-fa77cd68ac06","expr":"fieldName.length() == 0 || value != null || value == null","rationale":"Accepts that fieldName could be empty, for instance when appending anonymous values.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(String,Object):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:29.620527747Z"}
{"id":"813e124a-77d4-4177-bb03-58067ce357c9","expr":"value == null || value.toString() != null","rationale":"If value is not null, its toString() method returns a non-null String.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(Object):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:32.123914701Z"}
{"id":"f76f8025-c9fe-46c4-8ef7-7f165d88c978","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The append method returns 'this', so result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(Object):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:33.393957232Z"}
{"id":"82358ccc-5024-4de6-b9b1-ddb8ccd06c0b","expr":"value == null || result.toString().contains(value.toString())","rationale":"Normally the appended value is styled into the underlying buffer, so ToString result should reflect the value string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(Object):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:33.393957232Z"}
{"id":"c6d05582-27b6-4cd2-bbbc-a7953fd18191","expr":"result.toString().length() >= 0","rationale":"ToStringCreator's toString length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#append(Object):ToStringCreator","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:33.393957232Z"}
{"id":"f74e92fb-68c1-4686-8048-a7841bf86981","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The toString method of StringBuilder never returns null, so result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#toString():String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:34.004556470Z"}
{"id":"54a09af9-7da7-4f3a-898c-d8532646842c","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"The string representation is typically non-empty after appending fields.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.ToStringCreator#toString():String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/ToStringCreator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:34.004556470Z"}
{"id":"d593b982-f3e9-4769-ba2e-8731b496d352","expr":"value == null || value.toString() != null","rationale":"The method will eventually convert value to a styled string, likely relying on toString() without null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.StylerUtils#style(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/StylerUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:35.308919317Z"}
{"id":"3cf6b7dc-5adf-41de-8f61-d02f10f06e36","expr":"value != null","rationale":"Method accepts null but primary use is with non-null values.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.StylerUtils#style(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/StylerUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:35.308919317Z"}
{"id":"6dfc83af-c500-468b-8a45-60ce99e12702","expr":"value == null || value.getClass() != null","rationale":"If value is non-null, getClass() returns non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.StylerUtils#style(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/StylerUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:35.308919317Z"}
{"id":"5d50733e-d6fa-4595-b219-dba1ba9c62e2","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method uses DEFAULT_VALUE_STYLER.style(value), which likely never returns null, result should always be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.StylerUtils#style(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/StylerUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:35.441622814Z"}
{"id":"8c69561d-a4dd-4741-9189-80f35a224755","expr":"! (value == null) || result.length() > 0","rationale":"When value is non-null, the styled string usually has positive length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.StylerUtils#style(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/StylerUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:35.441622814Z"}
{"id":"f35c7eba-8ac0-4da1-97b0-944266d0e38e","expr":"! (result.isEmpty())","rationale":"Results from style should not be empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.StylerUtils#style(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/StylerUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:35.441622814Z"}
{"id":"99634987-3227-4060-bde1-5f4ea327b20f","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since styleNull() returns the hardcoded string \"null\", result must be the string \"null\" and therefore non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleNull():String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:37.005731789Z"}
{"id":"66cea826-d5b4-49d4-b566-5e10cce88562","expr":"\"null\".equals(result)","rationale":"The method returns the string literal \"null\" unconditionally, so result equals \"null\".","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleNull():String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:37.005731789Z"}
{"id":"1c2ffd0a-c82a-43d2-93b2-418c2c744ffd","expr":"result.length() == 4","rationale":"Because result is always the string \"null\", its length must be 4.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleNull():String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:37.005731789Z"}
{"id":"605ac477-db35-4ef8-b856-b023e8103c74","expr":"!result.isEmpty()","rationale":"The returned string is \"null\", which is not empty, so result.isEmpty() returns false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleNull():String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:37.005731789Z"}
{"id":"dc8e1a56-2ede-43de-8b3d-17b06fd78c12","expr":"str == null || !str.contains(\"\\\"\")","rationale":"Ensures the string doesn't contain double quotes which might complicate the styling.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:37.627664371Z"}
{"id":"48760bf3-59bf-4e01-af7c-821ad73e102c","expr":"str == null || str.length() >= 0","rationale":"String length should be non-negative if str is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:37.627664371Z"}
{"id":"b6e2786f-856d-48e5-85be-98780e463e64","expr":"str != null && str.equals(str)","rationale":"str is equal to itself when non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:37.627664371Z"}
{"id":"c5c03b9f-1e4d-4d45-a3f2-161a9e742db7","expr":"str == null || str.length() <= 1000","rationale":"Restricts string length to a reasonable maximum (example).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:37.627664371Z"}
{"id":"339d4b37-d37f-4e93-8661-818d154c58c0","expr":"str == null || !str.isEmpty() || str.isEmpty()","rationale":"The string is either empty or not empty; trivial but accurate.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:37.627664371Z"}
{"id":"1176700f-9253-4ff5-b2ac-418fd480c2f4","expr":"result.length() == (str == null ? 2 : str.length() + 2)","rationale":"The method always returns the input string surrounded by \" quotes, so the result length is input length plus 2.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:38.211695343Z"}
{"id":"65e80d05-d2fc-4f25-99d8-9dcadf209326","expr":"(str == null && result.equals(\"\\\"null\\\"\")) || (str != null && result.equals(\"\\\"\" + str + \"\\\"\"))","rationale":"The method returns a string composed by surrounding str with quotes, even when str is null (which results in \"null\")","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:38.211695343Z"}
{"id":"e45adfe3-02f7-43ff-a1c5-063f86f0d3b9","expr":"result.startsWith(\"\\\"\") && result.endsWith(\"\\\"\")","rationale":"Since the method adds quotes around the string, the result must start and end with a double quote.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:38.211695343Z"}
{"id":"66ad58a3-050c-4cf1-82e8-b785878ec1e8","expr":"str == null || result.contains(str)","rationale":"Because the input string is wrapped in quotes, it must be contained in the result unless str is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:38.211695343Z"}
{"id":"83b4139d-0aa7-44df-9440-477e9cd19f99","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Based on the implementation, the return value is constructed from string constants and str, never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleString(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:38.211695343Z"}
{"id":"bb479c21-8c49-46c7-8bb8-abd79de2c3ab","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The classStyler.apply(clazz) should not return null and hence result is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:39.018271567Z"}
{"id":"22b02ead-f666-4529-a67e-1acda2bbade9","expr":"result.contains(clazz.getSimpleName()) || result.contains(clazz.getName())","rationale":"Styling a Class object commonly includes its simple name or full name in the returned string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:39.018271567Z"}
{"id":"0c59f573-9fdb-41cd-b9a2-d465200f2389","expr":"result.length() >= clazz.getSimpleName().length()","rationale":"The styled string representation should contain at least the simple class name, so its length is not shorter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:39.018271567Z"}
{"id":"20d6fa35-9745-4050-a1ef-fd6e603c85b7","expr":"result.trim().length() > 0","rationale":"The styleClass method returns a visible non-empty styled string representation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:39.018271567Z"}
{"id":"a8782e50-37fe-4f26-8852-99da58178dbe","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method is expected to style a non-null Class object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:39.213418577Z"}
{"id":"4ae2595a-9530-4a39-8197-7abaea83e152","expr":"!clazz.isArray() || clazz.getComponentType() != null","rationale":"If clazz is an array type, its component type should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:39.213418577Z"}
{"id":"c0079ec6-d35b-4290-8592-0d636076ddc2","expr":"clazz.getPackage() == null || clazz.getPackage().getName().length() > 0","rationale":"If the class has a package, then the package name should be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:39.213418577Z"}
{"id":"c27bdd1d-efdd-478f-8c27-0e955e77e214","expr":"clazz.getSimpleName().length() > 0","rationale":"All non-anonymous classes should have a non-empty simple name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleClass(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:39.213418577Z"}
{"id":"0a81ae54-b7b5-4dd8-bd84-6aa5c1801e24","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter should not be null for proper styling.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:39.682094620Z"}
{"id":"98ef37fd-34a9-41de-96da-35bd8cc41900","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"Every Method instance has an associated declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:39.682094620Z"}
{"id":"3bbaaa80-c83d-406d-b85d-cd2f33d856a6","expr":"method.getName() != null && !method.getName().isEmpty()","rationale":"Method names are non-null and usually non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:39.682094620Z"}
{"id":"0e93e829-8f34-45c2-ae4c-783cbc81155c","expr":"method.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"Parameter count of a method is zero or more.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:39.682094620Z"}
{"id":"dc0c72b9-6eee-4db5-b54f-a02f64071a23","expr":"!method.isSynthetic()","rationale":"Typically styling is performed on non-synthetic methods, but synthetic methods might be rare.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMethod(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:39.682094620Z"}
{"id":"e1196b94-9b72-46be-ae60-e6206ed84e15","expr":"map != null","rationale":"The map parameter must be non-null to iterate over its entries safely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:41.035483146Z"}
{"id":"3cb3ef75-4121-48eb-9d1e-68aebce27d33","expr":"map.size() >= 0","rationale":"Map size is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:41.035483146Z"}
{"id":"3f3a6e29-ac20-48a3-bc66-35c722bcb274","expr":"map.entrySet() != null","rationale":"The entrySet returned by the map is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleMap(Map<K, V>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:41.035483146Z"}
{"id":"056a185a-7ab0-42e7-b4f9-58b96004c161","expr":"collection != null","rationale":"The method uses a for-each loop over collection, so collection must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:41.962126696Z"}
{"id":"f7f5a27a-f552-40f3-a1e4-4afa3d317075","expr":"collection.size() >= 0","rationale":"By Collection interface contract, size() returns a non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:41.962126696Z"}
{"id":"bff06400-c914-4f08-a172-d54d240478cd","expr":"(!collection.isEmpty() || collection.size() == 0)","rationale":"Either the collection is empty or its size is positive; this captures basic correctness constraint.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.style.SimpleValueStyler#styleCollection(Collection<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/core/style/SimpleValueStyler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:49:41.962126696Z"}
