{"id":"eb2f9e6b-bb53-426d-851c-259be3f3bf51","expr":"bridgeMethod != null","rationale":"The method expects a non-null bridgeMethod parameter to resolve the bridge.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.BridgeMethodResolver#resolveBridgeMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/core/BridgeMethodResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:50:11.678674323Z"}
