{"id":"4d7fbe87-5f96-44ab-b86a-665326402a13","expr":"(targetClass == bridgeMethod.getDeclaringClass()) || (targetClass != bridgeMethod.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"These express simple class equality or inequality on declaring class but are tautological or trivial.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.BridgeMethodResolver#resolveBridgeMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/core/BridgeMethodResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:50:11.678674323Z"}
