{"id":"9f30885e-5632-4ddd-8645-b3e48933207c","expr":"(!limitLength || result.length() <= 100)","rationale":"If limitLength is true, the result string length should not exceed 100 characters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#formatValue(Object,boolean):String","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:52:36.386971980Z"}
