{"id":"cbb4f02c-70b8-4f7e-8b21-82c160753670","expr":"logger != null && messageFactory != null","rationale":"The method requires both logger and messageFactory to be non-null to operate without NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.log.LogFormatUtils#traceDebug(Log,Function<Boolean, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/core/log/LogFormatUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T10:52:37.442377327Z"}
