{"id":"93304745-f406-45ca-b45a-3a225ead86eb","expr":"properties != null || properties == null","rationale":"properties can be null or non-null at method entry, state unknown; method assigns it as an element of an array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:17.271969961Z"}
{"id":"fba8167d-db0c-40dd-8605-85ac417bbd18","expr":"properties.size() >= 0","rationale":"Properties object has a size method reflecting number of key-value pairs, always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:17.271969961Z"}
{"id":"da5af245-3e06-4b93-90a2-43bead00780d","expr":"properties.isEmpty() || !properties.isEmpty()","rationale":"A valid properties instance can be either empty or not.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:17.271969961Z"}
{"id":"45695413-a7a2-427f-9936-1becfd7ff63b","expr":"properties.keySet() != null","rationale":"The keySet() method on Properties returns a non-null Set view of the keys.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:17.271969961Z"}
{"id":"f90cff4d-e0e1-4bf7-978d-ce83b1db424f","expr":"properties.containsKey(\"\") == false","rationale":"Properties are usually keyed by non-empty strings; unlikely to contain empty key.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:17.271969961Z"}
{"id":"28c42631-e281-4f2b-910f-0ef04eb5a96e","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method constructs a Resource object for the fallback location if no localized resource exists, thus result cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.LocalizedResourceHelper#findLocalizedResource(String,String,Locale):Resource","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/LocalizedResourceHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:17.963358212Z"}
{"id":"e1f45a14-6db6-400e-8f76-c97c5e4accc6","expr":"!(result.exists() == false && locale != null && !locale.getLanguage().isEmpty() && !locale.getCountry().isEmpty() && !locale.getVariant().isEmpty())","rationale":"The method attempts the resource with name_language_country_variant first if variant is non-empty, so if variant, language, country are all non-empty, resource should exist at least from that first check returning a result that exists.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.LocalizedResourceHelper#findLocalizedResource(String,String,Locale):Resource","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/LocalizedResourceHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:17.963358212Z"}
{"id":"f441ac66-4b67-4669-bb8a-5316d2f1826b","expr":"properties != null","rationale":"The method assigns an array wrapping the passed properties, so properties is expected to be non-null at exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:18.428993205Z"}
{"id":"d96173a9-9f46-42f6-bda6-fd1671569ecb","expr":"propertiesArray == null || propertiesArray.length >= 0","rationale":"The varargs parameter propertiesArray can be null or an array of zero or more Properties instances.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setPropertiesArray(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:19.885214052Z"}
{"id":"f865c027-9c78-4da5-b0b4-9d35e656e15f","expr":"propertiesArray == null || (propertiesArray.length == 0 || propertiesArray.length > 0)","rationale":"Explicitly captures that array length is a non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setPropertiesArray(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:19.885214052Z"}
{"id":"7d350cdb-4f3d-405f-843d-e5fb7ac40c17","expr":"location != null","rationale":"At method entry, the 'location' parameter is expected to be a non-null Resource object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocation(Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:21.341190677Z"}
{"id":"4b52e928-84aa-4177-a5e0-2f7c1603b3e4","expr":"location.exists() || true","rationale":"Resource may or may not exist; existence checked by calling exists() can be informative but not guaranteed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocation(Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:21.341190677Z"}
