{"id":"63afbb55-27c6-4e10-93ae-d90e54092e7f","expr":"location.getDescription() != null","rationale":"The resource description should typically be non-null for user information purposes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocation(Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:21.341190677Z"}
{"id":"8e6dbc5e-8ddb-4b40-931a-5a71104e3ba0","expr":"location.getFilename() == null || location.getFilename().length() > 0","rationale":"Filename is either null or a non-empty string identifying the resource; empty filename is not expected.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocation(Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:21.341190677Z"}
{"id":"f38d947e-76d9-44b8-98be-d261852d6256","expr":"locations != null || true","rationale":"locations can be null because the class field locations is annotated @Nullable.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocations(Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:21.961788472Z"}
{"id":"6fbfe1c4-32f6-4ab4-a80e-47a62b92a8e0","expr":"locations == null || locations.length >= 0","rationale":"If locations is not null, its length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocations(Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:21.961788472Z"}
{"id":"550948b5-7480-48d3-96d4-289ee49a3890","expr":"locations == null || locations.length == 0 || locations[0] != null","rationale":"If locations has elements, the first element is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocations(Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:21.961788472Z"}
{"id":"49226ab9-8c48-450d-9cfd-d4e7ac6b5ac0","expr":"(locations == null) || (locations.length >= 0)","rationale":"The locations parameter, if non-null, is an array and should have a valid length (zero or more).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocations(Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:22.345218852Z"}
{"id":"bc31bbfd-0126-43a3-83a2-88c319575fd0","expr":"localOverride == true || localOverride == false","rationale":"localOverride is boolean parameter thus either true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocalOverride(boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:22.451983100Z"}
{"id":"338deb89-cc0b-4cd9-9579-b64c4c28cce4","expr":"propertiesArray == null || true","rationale":"No specific constraints on elements of propertiesArray are imposed by this method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setPropertiesArray(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:22.695440600Z"}
{"id":"81017d00-645c-41d1-8ef7-79a01b2adbce","expr":"propertiesArray == null || propertiesArray.length >= 0","rationale":"This trivial but valid invariant reflects the nature of the array length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setPropertiesArray(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:22.695440600Z"}
{"id":"69f76a3c-6e36-49c2-97d7-31cbd873b51d","expr":"localOverride == true || localOverride == false","rationale":"The parameter is boolean, so the value must be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocalOverride(boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:24.136515422Z"}
{"id":"ae0a3606-c5b3-4713-976e-56cdfe888082","expr":"ignoreResourceNotFound == true || ignoreResourceNotFound == false","rationale":"The parameter is a boolean, so the value must be either true or false at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setIgnoreResourceNotFound(boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:24.621408908Z"}
