{"id":"118422cf-11c9-488f-b18f-c6e604655db9","expr":"propertiesPersister != null || propertiesPersister == null","rationale":"Though trivial, it acknowledges the nullability as per method signature","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setPropertiesPersister(PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:27.367862179Z"}
{"id":"0e6698d4-24ee-49ba-9127-e8ca5aacd7a2","expr":"encoding == null || !encoding.isEmpty() && encoding.trim().length() > 0","rationale":"If encoding is provided, it should be a non-empty non-blank string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setFileEncoding(String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:27.652108844Z"}
{"id":"0840e283-d2b4-44f4-b77a-613f93585c67","expr":"encoding == null || encoding.length() <= 50","rationale":"Encoding strings are typically short.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setFileEncoding(String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:27.652108844Z"}
{"id":"407a2433-5ae9-42d2-b398-653f922843a3","expr":"encoding == null || encoding.equals(encoding.trim())","rationale":"Encoding strings do not have leading or trailing whitespace if non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setFileEncoding(String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:27.652108844Z"}
{"id":"94cc696e-3da3-4ca8-9cbd-0cd3c18e97fc","expr":"encoding == null || encoding.equals(encoding.toUpperCase()) || encoding.equals(encoding.toLowerCase())","rationale":"Encoding strings are usually either all uppercase or all lowercase if non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setFileEncoding(String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:27.652108844Z"}
{"id":"c5012037-3583-465a-9aaf-60f0c647d169","expr":"propertiesPersister != null","rationale":"The method sets propertiesPersister to a non-null value either from the parameter or a default instance.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setPropertiesPersister(PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:29.928017409Z"}
{"id":"a4502f83-52a0-4117-9538-e45d4b60bd59","expr":"propertiesPersister == (propertiesPersister)","rationale":"The field propertiesPersister is assigned either the given parameter or a default singleton, so the reference always points to a PropertiesPersister object.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setPropertiesPersister(PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:29.928017409Z"}
{"id":"2f644a0b-b206-4a94-af5d-2e7bfb7a1047","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The result Properties object is always instantiated at method start, hence non-null on exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#mergeProperties():Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:31.288728351Z"}
{"id":"a3eda471-8e30-4381-9788-0617bc02a71c","expr":"encoding == null || encoding.isEmpty() || encoding.length() > 0","rationale":"The encoding string is either null or has a length property.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setFileEncoding(String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:33.314692056Z"}
{"id":"216fe1d3-bfeb-4437-be66-63edad688656","expr":"props != null","rationale":"props is the target Properties object passed in to be filled.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#loadProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:34.998900326Z"}
{"id":"cd1f1064-ed94-46a0-9d8f-2a1ea004810c","expr":"props.size() >= 0","rationale":"Properties stores 0 or more key-value pairs.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#loadProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:34.998900326Z"}
{"id":"3a0af2ac-2414-4657-9191-468af8c63d94","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"Ensures the resource parameter is provided and not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(EncodedResource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:35.261183394Z"}
{"id":"c27ae98f-4b99-499e-8d69-b8ae11702116","expr":"resource.getResource() != null","rationale":"The underlying Resource inside EncodedResource must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(EncodedResource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:35.261183394Z"}
