{"id":"66b69f38-0d06-440a-8379-74b3bba39cfb","expr":"result.size() >= 0","rationale":"Properties.size() returns a non-negative count of keys loaded.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(EncodedResource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:37.144790131Z"}
{"id":"06c9f009-1959-49cd-9e51-d0fdec7f0bd8","expr":"resource.exists() || result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If the resource does not exist, properties should be empty, otherwise the properties may be loaded.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(EncodedResource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:37.144790131Z"}
{"id":"ac9c06f4-448c-4b4a-9d8e-f662da72b77d","expr":"props != null","rationale":"The method requires a Properties instance to load into.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:38.726762256Z"}
{"id":"ad78c10d-59a5-43b0-a6cb-f4117cf42ead","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"The method requires a resource to read properties from.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:38.726762256Z"}
{"id":"76f453ae-fb81-414f-8885-cb8ed8a3a276","expr":"resource.getResource() != null","rationale":"The EncodedResource encapsulates a Resource which should not be null for loading properties.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:38.726762256Z"}
{"id":"c25d2b1d-a9ae-4e58-aafb-0cdb118174c2","expr":"resource.getEncoding() == null || resource.getEncoding().length() > 0","rationale":"The encoding string must be either null or a valid non-empty encoding name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:38.726762256Z"}
{"id":"5a9b83a6-4be2-4c00-b33e-848f82c9f900","expr":"props != null","rationale":"The method fills the given Properties object, so props should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:39.143615285Z"}
