{"id":"fbbf9b58-189e-4fa0-a5ec-fa7f2d61dcf2","expr":"resourceName.length() > 0","rationale":"The resource name string must have positive length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:44.977336111Z"}
{"id":"6da351bb-4c05-4aa2-a48e-b29d26b633c7","expr":"resourceName.indexOf(' ') < 0","rationale":"Resource names usually do not contain whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:44.977336111Z"}
{"id":"50831548-d3c7-4bd8-84fc-9c90bab3e582","expr":"props != null","rationale":"The method fills the provided props instance; it cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:45.833027578Z"}
{"id":"819f7255-c090-4d57-b63a-6633f507cabd","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"The resource must be valid to load properties from it.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:45.833027578Z"}
{"id":"8cea3a9b-567b-4da8-9479-8e136c29f542","expr":"resource.getFilename() == null || (resource.getFilename() != null && (resource.getFilename().endsWith(\".xml\") || !resource.getFilename().endsWith(\".xml\")))","rationale":"The resource filename may be null or any string with or without .xml extension.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:45.833027578Z"}
{"id":"e95282a0-006a-4298-aeb7-08ce793216cb","expr":"props.size() >= 0","rationale":"Properties stores mappings and its size is never negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:45.833027578Z"}
{"id":"2ec1ab04-bf84-4e1a-9a21-7a4fc11991bf","expr":"resource.getInputStream() != null","rationale":"The input stream should be available from resource.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:45.833027578Z"}
{"id":"420546c1-6bc8-4861-92a0-47b129d34dd1","expr":"resourceName != null","rationale":"The method asserts resourceName is not null, so it is always non-null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String,ClassLoader):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:46.244128984Z"}
{"id":"655d044a-9c57-4671-8ac9-f4fe64da2a6e","expr":"resourceName.length() > 0","rationale":"Resource names should not be empty strings when used for resource loading.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String,ClassLoader):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:46.244128984Z"}
{"id":"dd49d727-d8c8-480b-988a-234a3d3fb905","expr":"(!resourceName.isEmpty())","rationale":"resourceName should not be an empty string as per typical usage.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String,ClassLoader):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:46.244128984Z"}
{"id":"92619be5-fa7a-4fb7-9f6a-df05fd6e2ff4","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method is documented to return a populated Properties instance. Hence, result should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:47.715337840Z"}
{"id":"7b95bff9-cecb-4d61-aec9-81c9a4940a56","expr":"resourceName == null || resourceName.isEmpty() || result.isEmpty() || result.size() > 0","rationale":"If resourceName is null or empty, the resulting Properties may be empty (size 0); otherwise, result can have size more than 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:47.715337840Z"}
{"id":"6e3fc204-afb4-4595-837d-e1fad4831255","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a Properties object, never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String,ClassLoader):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:48.531353811Z"}
{"id":"b17e494a-8085-4513-9022-6dc18a8d982b","expr":"!(resourceName.endsWith(\".xml\") && result.isEmpty())","rationale":"If resourceName ends with .xml and resources are found, properties should be loaded via loadFromXML, so likely result is not empty if resources exist.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadAllProperties(String,ClassLoader):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:48.531353811Z"}
{"id":"0e0dc1dd-2855-4cb6-ae89-61aac3b4caac","expr":"result == null || result.toString() != null","rationale":"If result is not null, toString() should return a non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#getVisitorAttributes():Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:50.352730210Z"}
{"id":"a61c5790-5dd5-4f32-8514-57b5c67e617f","expr":"result == null || result.hashCode() == result.hashCode()","rationale":"hashCode() is stable for the given result object during method execution.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#getVisitorAttributes():Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:50.352730210Z"}
{"id":"76deea45-2a71-4b88-acab-29b816be04ff","expr":"result == null || result.equals(result)","rationale":"Equals is reflexive: an object is equal to itself.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#getVisitorAttributes():Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:50.352730210Z"}
{"id":"e88ecd74-2737-40e5-ad6c-c922e0f8dc15","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns path if not null, otherwise empty string, so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#getPath(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:50.841001012Z"}
{"id":"15c67e40-0c6a-49d3-975a-dfe6be719766","expr":"resource != null || result.equals(\"\")","rationale":"If resource is null, likely doGetPath returns null, so result is empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#getPath(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:50.841001012Z"}
{"id":"189ac0d7-fc87-486c-bfae-65e2cae2dd5e","expr":"result.length() >= 0","rationale":"result is a String, so its length is always ≥0; this is a basic fact rather than insightful invariant.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#getPath(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:50.841001012Z"}
{"id":"219ae004-1ac3-4e25-8cdb-364069f77842","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"Since getPath operates on the resource, it is typical that resource is not null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#getPath(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:51.479130754Z"}
{"id":"422b160e-e912-46d0-843b-101cb0499866","expr":"resource.toString() != null","rationale":"Since doGetPath likely uses resource.toString() internally, resource.toString() should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#getPath(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:51.479130754Z"}
{"id":"8a3e0bb6-f0af-4fa7-9245-b3435a0b5d63","expr":"resource.getClass() != null","rationale":"resource.getClass() is non-null whenever resource is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#getPath(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:51.479130754Z"}
{"id":"0b60fa3e-903b-4f6b-b3b7-e034746250f2","expr":"resource != null || resource == null","rationale":"No other direct constraints known at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#getPath(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:51.479130754Z"}
{"id":"fd962a3b-684d-4c60-88c0-5913fff73f3c","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The getRoot method is expected to return a non-null root object for a valid url.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#findRoot(URL):Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:51.934429228Z"}
{"id":"54663da9-ad7b-49c1-b908-ef114c71b7c2","expr":"url != null","rationale":"The URL parameter must not be null because the method calls getRoot(url) immediately.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#findRoot(URL):Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:52.188258869Z"}
{"id":"7013a499-5fb0-4aab-8329-9142bd546e6b","expr":"url.getProtocol() != null","rationale":"For a valid URL input, the protocol should be defined.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#findRoot(URL):Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:52.188258869Z"}
{"id":"fb10efb9-4b70-4e23-8027-ab0e2f439f03","expr":"url.toExternalForm().startsWith(url.getProtocol())","rationale":"The external string form of the URL usually starts with the protocol.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#findRoot(URL):Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:52.188258869Z"}
{"id":"3c042e6e-ab83-4cde-8c68-2713475ea8b4","expr":"url.getPath() != null","rationale":"The path part of the URL should be non-null for valid URLs.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#findRoot(URL):Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:52.188258869Z"}
{"id":"97933afa-e5b9-494a-914e-c67d13ae97b6","expr":"!url.getPath().isEmpty()","rationale":"Finding root likely requires a non-empty path in the URL.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#findRoot(URL):Object","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:52.188258869Z"}
{"id":"d2c46ca4-9fe3-4512-a605-c505967e4836","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"The method uses resource as a parameter to a method call, implying it is not null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#visit(Object,InvocationHandler):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:54.807984276Z"}
{"id":"947850d0-bf3d-4aa7-aaae-74a420093147","expr":"visitor != null","rationale":"The visitor handler is required to create a proxy instance, which implies it is not null on method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#visit(Object,InvocationHandler):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:54.807984276Z"}
{"id":"63fbdd17-c2a8-47f8-b91f-4941bdf4e551","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"The resource is passed to invokeVfsMethod, implying it must be non-null before method execution.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#visit(Object,InvocationHandler):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:55.135603928Z"}
{"id":"807b1211-9c5a-4ff8-b181-2b58a6f3d93d","expr":"visitor != null","rationale":"The visitor argument is used to create a proxy instance and hence must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.VfsPatternUtils#visit(Object,InvocationHandler):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/VfsPatternUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:55.135603928Z"}
{"id":"301c3f9d-3d0a-421a-bf09-f57b9f0d0131","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"name is passed around for identification purposes and is expected to be a meaningful string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.ResourcePropertySource#withName(String):ResourcePropertySource","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/ResourcePropertySource.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:01:55.552928886Z"}
