{"id":"f9a57105-a89b-44be-bd00-e21baa550707","expr":"escapeCharacter == null || escapeCharacter.charValue() >= 0","rationale":"Ensures that if escapeCharacter is not null, its numeric value is non-negative, which is always true for char but stated here explicitly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractEnvironment#setEscapeCharacter(Character):void","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractEnvironment.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:07:59.170498567Z"}
