{"id":"d763c4d3-1907-439d-ac36-451da63e4843","expr":"key != null && !key.isEmpty()","rationale":"The property key is expected to be a non-null and non-empty string to fetch a property.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#getProperty(String,Class<T>,T):T","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:08:45.393845682Z"}
