{"id":"fd844e73-b98c-45f2-962f-533aa770dcd7","expr":"defaultValue == null || result != null","rationale":"The method returns defaultValue if property is null, so result is non-null if defaultValue is specified.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#getProperty(String,String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:08:45.739001355Z"}
{"id":"c9f85809-bcbc-499c-8fca-cb29007b9db6","expr":"key != null","rationale":"The 'key' parameter should not be null before accessing properties using it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#getProperty(String,String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:08:45.975159319Z"}
{"id":"6db603c9-13f9-470c-993f-8d6a33556f4e","expr":"key.length() > 0","rationale":"Usually, key strings are non-empty identifiers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#getProperty(String,String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:08:45.975159319Z"}
{"id":"695941f2-7602-4ca4-b9b8-1ce5dce94ef3","expr":"defaultValue == null || !defaultValue.isEmpty()","rationale":"It's common that the defaultValue, when non-null, is a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#getProperty(String,String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:08:45.975159319Z"}
