{"id":"f5dd7712-051d-4d32-98f6-2d0515527950","expr":"result == null || targetType.isInstance(result)","rationale":"The result must be either null or an instance of the targetType as the conversion or retrieval enforces this.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#getProperty(String,Class<T>,T):T","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:08:47.113891234Z"}
{"id":"4aac36bf-0585-43f7-9311-5ea04d2850ef","expr":"result != null || defaultValue == null || result == defaultValue","rationale":"If result is null, then the returned value is defaultValue (which could also be null).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#getProperty(String,Class<T>,T):T","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:08:47.113891234Z"}
{"id":"93eb338c-064d-4faa-89bd-ec8dd4038dfe","expr":"result != null || defaultValue != null","rationale":"If result is null, then the return will be defaultValue, which must be not null for result to be null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#getProperty(String,Class<T>,T):T","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:08:47.113891234Z"}
