{"id":"35b92271-326b-4013-aab1-75522d4724b7","expr":"!result.negate().test(null) || constructor != null","rationale":"If the result predicate tested with null does not return true, then constructor must be not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.predicate.ReflectionHintsPredicates#onConstructorInvocation(Constructor<?>):Predicate<RuntimeHints>","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/predicate/ReflectionHintsPredicates.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:14:36.405831660Z"}
{"id":"f5f111bc-ec95-4287-af9d-eb7266f7bad3","expr":"constructor != null","rationale":"The method asserts the constructor parameter is not null before usage.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.predicate.ReflectionHintsPredicates#onConstructorInvocation(Constructor<?>):Predicate<RuntimeHints>","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/predicate/ReflectionHintsPredicates.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:14:36.935558343Z"}
