{"id":"e7912f85-e71f-4b1c-a03d-32eaa46ba320","expr":"result.test(null) == false","rationale":"While speculative, the returned predicate generally tests runtime hints for reflection and may return false for null input.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.predicate.ReflectionHintsPredicates#onMethodInvocation(Class<?>,String):Predicate<RuntimeHints>","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/predicate/ReflectionHintsPredicates.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:14:41.262838756Z"}
