{"id":"2812c59f-aae0-438e-adfb-e8d80e6e32d9","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The method exits early if 'type' is null, so at this point 'type' is guaranteed non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#buildName(TypeReference,StringBuilder):void","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:16:15.985832596Z"}
{"id":"305f2345-33a9-4a4a-8dec-07d5730f5253","expr":"sb.length() > 0","rationale":"Since the method inserts the type name into 'sb', the builder should have length greater than zero before returning.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#buildName(TypeReference,StringBuilder):void","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:16:15.985832596Z"}
