{"id":"066821ab-1b3e-4d2f-bbb5-a28edba71b60","expr":"sb.toString().endsWith(type.getSimpleName())","rationale":"After insertion, the StringBuilder ends with the simple name of the given type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.aot.hint.SimpleTypeReference#buildName(TypeReference,StringBuilder):void","file":"org/springframework/aot/hint/SimpleTypeReference.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:16:15.985832596Z"}
