{"id":"10e4d621-1fba-47e7-8a1c-6e8b612f7881","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method getParameterTypes() on a Method object does not return null according to standard Java reflection API.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.reflect.FastMethod#getParameterTypes():Class[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/reflect/FastMethod.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:19:59.488573467Z"}
