{"id":"f0588769-8050-4153-84f7-f93b25c51c8b","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The name is used to compute a property name; null or empty names would likely cause issues.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AccessFieldTransformer#declare_field(int,String,Type,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AccessFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:20:51.990569389Z"}
