{"id":"d15ce253-9a16-45a3-8b93-e7472980b50c","expr":"obj != null && name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The intercepted read operation logically requires a non-null target object and a non-empty field name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readInt(Object,String,int):int","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:01.664351726Z"}
