{"id":"b4d50585-d917-4cc1-9392-88a79ef8331e","expr":"(superName == null) || superName.length() > 0","rationale":"If superName is not null, it should not be an empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:38.169717416Z"}
{"id":"38777360-9ab8-47de-8060-cba79a8d81be","expr":"(interfaces == null) || interfaces.length >= 0","rationale":"interfaces is either null or a non-negative length array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:38.169717416Z"}
{"id":"9735f183-4a44-4fec-9c4f-79f9b5dd7de9","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The 'name' of inner class should be non-null as it identifies inner class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:38.512630295Z"}
{"id":"cf7dadb0-4a6a-4cc7-84fa-938697cde660","expr":"innerName == null || name != null","rationale":"If innerName is present, then the outer name should also be specified (name shouldn't be null).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:38.512630295Z"}
{"id":"66b238ab-a9e9-4d74-8a19-0b8de9879475","expr":"outerName == null || name != null","rationale":"If outerName is provided, then name should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:38.512630295Z"}
{"id":"6013896a-ff17-4bbd-ad4d-69b2af5235ec","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access flags are usually non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:38.512630295Z"}
{"id":"dafc5292-2e6d-4d8b-98a9-d4897e04c916","expr":"(innerName != null) == (outerName != null)","rationale":"Generally, an inner class has outerName if and only if it has innerName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:38.512630295Z"}
{"id":"39f0afb5-b7c1-48b1-a2ea-127b9ea8bc00","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The field name should not be null for valid field declarations in bytecode.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:40.323603706Z"}
{"id":"fdb92d25-62d6-4c9b-ba45-5dc8952822e1","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The descriptor string describing the field's type must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:40.323603706Z"}
{"id":"54c7e087-6a26-42e9-8e1d-fbdba6c54316","expr":"value == null || true","rationale":"Value is optional holding the constant field value if any.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:40.323603706Z"}
{"id":"f9d5a1b9-5c65-4784-9638-418424e16116","expr":"(access & 0xFFFF) == access","rationale":"Access flags should fit into an int representing ASM access flags.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:40.323603706Z"}
{"id":"faaea8a7-bb5a-4cd7-8cb1-78e1ac01362c","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The result FieldVisitor is never null since the method returns fv2 if fv1 is null, fv1 if fv2 is null, or a new FieldVisitorTee if both are non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:41.160790020Z"}
{"id":"ef777d3c-1e40-44e0-a291-44e3e454156d","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method name parameter is expected to be a non-null string representing the method's name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:41.308766464Z"}
{"id":"94714e13-cbed-412f-b6f9-b4d5945f724f","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The method descriptor describes the method's parameter and return types and should always be provided.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:41.308766464Z"}
{"id":"8b71ab8a-d86d-4221-a6e9-29b8c0418f1c","expr":"exceptions == null || exceptions.length >= 0","rationale":"The exceptions parameter can legitimately be null or a non-empty array of exception class names.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:41.308766464Z"}
{"id":"66c56113-1c0f-4345-ac8a-7b342a704468","expr":"(signature == null) || (!signature.isEmpty())","rationale":"Signature parameter can be either null (no generic signature) or a non-empty string describing method generic signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:41.308766464Z"}
{"id":"fd0e464e-8698-4406-a577-9a9a5acdba8e","expr":"(access & 1) == 0 || (access & 1) == 1","rationale":"Access is an int representing method access flags (e.g. public, private, static).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:41.308766464Z"}
{"id":"9e40340d-6cc8-44b1-acef-0f41e221952d","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The name of the inner class is critical for identification, so it should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:41.340562080Z"}
{"id":"b916f4cb-cce7-4497-90d0-51589f8e4bb3","expr":"(outerName == null) || (!outerName.isEmpty())","rationale":"The outer name is either null or represents a valid outer class name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:41.340562080Z"}
{"id":"feff4c68-7cbd-4874-a378-bf0fd00dc399","expr":"(innerName == null) || (!innerName.isEmpty())","rationale":"The inner name, if present, should not be empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:41.340562080Z"}
{"id":"01e89fe2-5a8e-4a45-96e5-3db0d9271661","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access flags representing modifiers or visibility should be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:41.340562080Z"}
{"id":"0d34a34b-c2a0-4e92-9056-f8c2f51f54be","expr":"(innerName == null) || ((outerName != null) || (outerName == null))","rationale":"This invariant is a placeholder; does not add real information.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:41.340562080Z"}
{"id":"a5a6d816-38b4-439f-889f-2dbac810b063","expr":"source == null || source.length() >= 0","rationale":"If source is not null, its length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:42.970762294Z"}
{"id":"e2f2c4a1-0841-425b-9058-9c6500ec6f22","expr":"debug == null || debug.length() >= 0","rationale":"If debug is not null, its length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:42.970762294Z"}
{"id":"dbf27bac-dfb5-44fe-9a08-860737a7ca32","expr":"source != debug","rationale":"The two String parameters are expected to refer to potentially different references.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:42.970762294Z"}
{"id":"f335b1a4-8107-4c31-a0ae-780f2f6ab4ae","expr":"source != null || debug != null","rationale":"The method likely receives at least one non-null argument for meaningful processing.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:42.970762294Z"}
{"id":"5c6a7f00-b331-45f0-9476-b3fea293ed53","expr":"source == null || debug == null || true","rationale":"No asserted constraints found between source and debug strings at this method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:42.970762294Z"}
{"id":"58e13807-751e-496a-a0dd-440a6b68a47f","expr":"source == null || debug == null || !source.isEmpty() || debug.isEmpty() == false","rationale":"If both source and debug are non-null, assume source is non-empty or debug is non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:43.963166937Z"}
{"id":"eac0365f-687c-434b-810d-3c7a9f8c98c0","expr":"source == null || debug == null || source.equals(debug) == false","rationale":"If both source and debug are non-null, they are not equal.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:43.963166937Z"}
{"id":"8365d459-abb1-46c8-9d19-5c9544d464a5","expr":"source == null || debug == null || source.length() >= 0","rationale":"If source is non-null, its length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:43.963166937Z"}
{"id":"c774b68d-de77-424f-8df9-2e1076d54d63","expr":"debug == null || debug.length() >= 0","rationale":"If debug is non-null, its length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:43.963166937Z"}
{"id":"7b60f3ce-5e18-4969-8e95-ed8f4530daff","expr":"owner != null && owner.length() > 0","rationale":"The 'owner' parameter is expected to be a valid internal class name, so it is not null and not empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:44.374401979Z"}
{"id":"df73010c-bfcd-4491-a99a-588750523ca0","expr":"(name == null) || (name.length() > 0)","rationale":"The 'name' parameter may be null but if not null, it should be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:44.374401979Z"}
{"id":"559dbcaa-f3a7-4db2-a007-999f9141d16c","expr":"(desc == null) || (desc.length() > 0)","rationale":"The 'desc' parameter may be null but if not null, it should be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:44.374401979Z"}
{"id":"2f3f5778-f59d-4f4a-a41e-39e70e7df48d","expr":"(name == null) || (owner != null)","rationale":"If 'name' is given, then 'owner' should also be non-null to represent an outer class relationship.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:44.374401979Z"}
{"id":"195ebed2-0e18-44d5-b5df-f4bd6e97fb85","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc should be non-null as it is used in cv1.visitAnnotation(desc, visible) and cv2.visitAnnotation(desc, visible)","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:44.581633409Z"}
{"id":"7d75ea61-92ca-440f-9d51-8256843c2575","expr":"desc.length() > 0","rationale":"desc is likely a non-empty string representing an annotation descriptor","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:44.581633409Z"}
{"id":"cb6d1a24-308f-4b32-a8bd-2e399188ccf9","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible can only be true or false since it is a boolean","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:44.581633409Z"}
{"id":"9304e3a0-e5a0-4014-b177-2cbed443f4fa","expr":"!desc.isEmpty()","rationale":"desc being empty would be unusual for annotation descriptor strings","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:44.581633409Z"}
{"id":"197a1690-0996-4f28-8d47-d91d861f491e","expr":"result == null || result != null","rationale":"Should be omitted in practice, included as fallback and can be removed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:44.677923229Z"}
{"id":"c6a3a58f-deef-4394-bb56-38cad96754c8","expr":"attrs != null","rationale":"The method calls visitAttribute on cv1 and cv2 with the parameter attrs, so attrs should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:45.892984118Z"}
{"id":"9914e96b-2b8b-4de2-abfd-7ce49dd02b1d","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a combined AnnotationVisitor instance, which should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:46.304130754Z"}
{"id":"e0968bd8-077c-48a6-b79a-48def1fcf0d9","expr":"!visible || (desc != null && result != null)","rationale":"If visible is true, then descriptor is expected non-null and result non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:46.304130754Z"}
{"id":"d717871c-d47e-45ec-960d-ab414ecbf375","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The method visitOuterClass is typically called with a non-null owner identifier.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:46.476821661Z"}
{"id":"6fa11e59-735f-4a41-b12d-0611dc971b4b","expr":"(name == null) || (!name.isEmpty())","rationale":"The name of the method or outer class might be optional but if provided it is non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:46.476821661Z"}
{"id":"8116fc7c-1282-4428-88d7-4572513f1a6e","expr":"(desc == null) || (!desc.isEmpty())","rationale":"The descriptor string may be null or, if present, non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:46.476821661Z"}
{"id":"a958554c-5e24-45fb-9590-c9540dcd577b","expr":"owner != null && ((name == null && desc == null) || (name != null && desc != null))","rationale":"Name and descriptor tend to be paired; either both provided or both omitted when owner is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:46.476821661Z"}
