{"id":"6f8073e3-1a4d-4ad2-9116-7604a42079bf","expr":"debug == null || debug.length() >= 0","rationale":"If debug is non-null, it has a non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:54.661807002Z"}
{"id":"47b45f6c-b728-4af9-822f-e868e96c0f69","expr":"source == null || !source.isEmpty()","rationale":"When source is non-null, it is typically expected to have meaningful content.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:54.661807002Z"}
