{"id":"dd668f37-7a1f-4718-b81d-c96ddeed8f52","expr":"interfaces != null","rationale":"The method uses the interfaces array which should not be null when visiting a class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:54.686188617Z"}
