{"id":"93978a5f-a68b-4b48-8dbc-aeda92d772c9","expr":"version >= 0","rationale":"The version parameter generally corresponds to API level or class file version, which should be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:56.156945173Z"}
{"id":"c708c96b-f343-4d92-bdd9-1d18978dcd64","expr":"signature == null || signature.length() >= 0","rationale":"Signature is nullable, but if present, is expected to be a valid string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:56.156945173Z"}
{"id":"329a2c69-b5db-4163-ac3e-91b30a3a078e","expr":"source == null || source.length() >= 0","rationale":"The source string is either null or a non-null String with non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:56.750693404Z"}
{"id":"e516504f-60c7-4f31-9d33-7adf29007dff","expr":"debug == null || debug.length() >= 0","rationale":"The debug string is either null or a non-null String with non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:56.750693404Z"}
{"id":"fdef4740-4bf0-4133-9ba8-540aa6559737","expr":"(debug == null && source == null) || (debug != null || source != null)","rationale":"No specific implication between source and debug being null or non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:21:56.750693404Z"}
