{"id":"3176d5c9-9584-44fe-9bbf-41b1e82e1fa8","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The 'owner' string should be non-null as it identifies the class of the method invoking.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:23.746670151Z"}
{"id":"416e164e-d9cf-4270-addf-4a5dd8dc2fdc","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method name string for the invoked method should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:23.746670151Z"}
{"id":"415d1f9a-124d-445d-9a9f-991da484fc2b","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"Method descriptor string describing the invoked method should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:23.746670151Z"}
{"id":"e8688c6a-d530-464f-a3b5-e00eea3249ff","expr":"owner.length() > 0 && name.length() > 0 && desc.length() > 0","rationale":"The owner, name, and desc strings should be non-empty to represent a valid method call.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:23.746670151Z"}
{"id":"985adb4e-65b8-4b72-b72f-3a30bdb6fbcd","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The label argument is used as a jump target and should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:23.914202022Z"}
{"id":"ec1f58d4-4995-433e-8e3b-897129caf0c4","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode values represent bytecode instructions and typically are non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:23.914202022Z"}
{"id":"837b3421-30a5-4a0f-965e-7e2d367bf116","expr":"opcode <= 255","rationale":"Bytecode opcodes fit within a byte range 0-255.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:23.914202022Z"}
{"id":"6c27aed1-dbab-41a3-82b7-924dc7d44574","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The 'owner' parameter represents the class or interface on which the method is called, which must be a non-null internal name string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:24.798172218Z"}
{"id":"f0cf0bf1-f16a-4b9f-ab73-bf35052a85cf","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The 'name' parameter is the method name, which must be a non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:24.798172218Z"}
{"id":"5c26989c-8dbd-4da2-a3c0-5eddecc11ca7","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The 'desc' parameter describes the method signature descriptor, which must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:24.798172218Z"}
{"id":"af7e6b0a-b95e-4e9a-9294-f6c5c688167f","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"The 'opcode' integer represents bytecode instruction opcode which should be in a valid range of non-negative values","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:24.798172218Z"}
{"id":"0f29255d-45f4-4873-99ad-51af5421e695","expr":"(!itf || (itf && opcode == 185))","rationale":"If the itf boolean is true, indicating the method call is to an interface, opcode should be 185 (INVOKEINTERFACE).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:24.798172218Z"}
{"id":"83f21b15-bc45-4223-a21f-5a7d3150da23","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The visitJumpInsn method requires a valid label to indicate the jump target.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:25.444769652Z"}
{"id":"0420b2aa-9b20-4507-aad3-fe3825436fee","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode values must be valid non-negative bytecode instruction identifiers.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:25.444769652Z"}
{"id":"1402c4b0-9fda-4fa6-825f-5898709ae9e7","expr":"opcode <= 200","rationale":"The opcode is expected to be within the valid ASM opcode range.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:25.444769652Z"}
{"id":"34303850-beab-4e9a-a8bd-9fdbc80514db","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The owner parameter representing the class name in internal form must be non-null to denote the method's class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:26.328319374Z"}
{"id":"e408e819-d344-4338-8ff3-73489bc4cd2c","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method name must be specified and is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:26.328319374Z"}
{"id":"7e869cc9-f753-4ef2-8ac9-f6b68485c970","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The method descriptor is required to indicate the method signature and must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:26.328319374Z"}
{"id":"3c4f5bf9-60f7-4dcb-b3b9-5d3a1486c1c8","expr":"(itf && opcode == 185) || (!itf || opcode != 185)","rationale":"If the method is an interface method invocation (opcode 185), the itf flag should be true, otherwise false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:26.328319374Z"}
{"id":"593e9511-9fb4-4dc2-a720-3ecdbad67b4e","expr":"opcode == 182 || opcode == 183 || opcode == 184 || opcode == 185","rationale":"The opcode should correspond to one of the method invocation opcodes handled by visitMethodInsn.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:26.328319374Z"}
{"id":"b67e6986-a169-4ac6-9a31-ff9f4993987d","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The method visitLabel is called on mv1 and mv2 with label as argument, so label cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:26.509415023Z"}
{"id":"b311a0cf-d1f9-4f47-acf1-4953a268a651","expr":"var >= 0","rationale":"In JVM bytecode, local variable indices used in increment instructions are typically non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:26.608005554Z"}
{"id":"096c2fcd-0205-4170-935a-bc459848657d","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"The increment parameter usually represents an actual change, so it is commonly non-zero.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:26.608005554Z"}
{"id":"d4c076b2-a044-4105-97b6-800d977b02ed","expr":"cst != null","rationale":"The constant passed to visitLdcInsn is typically non-null to represent a literal value.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:27.873989258Z"}
{"id":"33892424-2971-4d8e-9d78-9fe921ac671b","expr":"label != null","rationale":"Since the method always delegates to mv1.visitLabel(label) and mv2.visitLabel(label), label should not be null to avoid NullPointerExceptions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:28.379217995Z"}
{"id":"e18023d7-4370-4ca7-b412-9de8e457a4e0","expr":"!label.equals(null)","rationale":"Avoid null label as visitLabel expects a Label object.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:28.379217995Z"}
{"id":"3b2bfc85-344a-437d-8ff7-2c0a25d08652","expr":"cst != null","rationale":"cst is passed to two method visitors' visitLdcInsn methods which may expect a non-null constant.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:28.450477765Z"}
{"id":"710a9d59-fe92-4c1e-936c-e5d783082901","expr":"cst == null || cst.toString() != null","rationale":"If cst is not null, calling toString() should not return null, ensuring it has a valid string representation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:28.450477765Z"}
{"id":"7061e9eb-3f1d-4022-b44e-59c437b67246","expr":"var >= 0","rationale":"The variable index 'var' should be non-negative as it corresponds to local variable indices in bytecode.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:29.359816585Z"}
{"id":"17db134b-f1ff-437c-a642-afccdc15ab07","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"Typically, the increment for IINC (increment local variable) is non-zero to have meaning.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:29.359816585Z"}
{"id":"1463a803-1db4-44a9-991d-30f03fdb6c23","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"The labels array parameter must be non-null since it contains the target labels for the table switch instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:29.621677939Z"}
{"id":"0144cef9-4b1b-42e7-8131-3c349df6954e","expr":"labels.length == (max - min + 1)","rationale":"The length of labels array should equal the number of valid cases which is max - min + 1.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:29.621677939Z"}
{"id":"25b4c42d-1ecf-4a76-903f-2543ab62b78a","expr":"max >= min","rationale":"The max value must be greater than or equal to min because the switch range should be valid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:29.621677939Z"}
{"id":"11a5de22-7586-4339-9eae-905c60f211dd","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"The default label must be non-null to ensure there is a fallback case in the table switch instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:29.621677939Z"}
{"id":"9efcecfe-b1c9-42cf-8faa-cbf05cc89b9b","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"The default label for the lookup switch instruction is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:29.776121931Z"}
{"id":"32c91b0d-b551-48e0-b5c8-da382eec4d26","expr":"keys != null","rationale":"The lookup keys array must be non-null to indicate the cases for the switch instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:29.776121931Z"}
{"id":"cb0673a2-dc8f-4fa4-9b0f-4d7beb8d98e2","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"The labels array associated with keys must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:29.776121931Z"}
{"id":"65cdd9f1-5bf2-4954-a336-6064d5a2ab0f","expr":"keys.length == labels.length","rationale":"Each key must have a corresponding label; arrays must be of equal length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:29.776121931Z"}
{"id":"99efbc92-b3fa-4689-bbde-cc122ad7f023","expr":"min <= max","rationale":"Ensures the range defined by min and max is valid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:31.175735615Z"}
{"id":"dc0d450e-bd09-47eb-8d3f-e499fe3515b0","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"The labels parameter should not be null since it's passed to the underlying visitors.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:31.175735615Z"}
{"id":"d348fef1-0943-4dce-9d75-168a70ec9b85","expr":"labels.length == (max - min + 1)","rationale":"Ensures correct mapping of labels to switch cases.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:31.175735615Z"}
{"id":"ea423a1b-e311-4313-9137-33d619eafae5","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"Default label identifies fallback path for the switch instruction.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:31.175735615Z"}
{"id":"30326bf4-bee2-4631-8130-e4dfa0b403c4","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc must be non-null to represent a valid type descriptor string for array creation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:31.783715832Z"}
{"id":"94d70e44-ec8a-476b-97fa-073599712f26","expr":"dims > 0","rationale":"dims represents the number of dimensions for the array, which must be positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:31.783715832Z"}
{"id":"36761e1f-5f1b-44d3-b266-bb8d48094157","expr":"desc.startsWith(\"[\")","rationale":"The descriptor for a multi-dimensional array type starts with '[' characters in JVM descriptor format.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:31.783715832Z"}
{"id":"799dacad-aeb1-4f66-8ffb-7030057a8533","expr":"desc.length() >= dims","rationale":"Number of '[' in the descriptor must be at least dims to represent the correct array dimensions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:31.783715832Z"}
{"id":"6bad5432-fa8d-4bba-b8ac-44d0c0f03f66","expr":"!desc.isEmpty()","rationale":"Descriptor string must not be empty for a valid type descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:31.783715832Z"}
{"id":"c9ee3f3f-08bd-4bcc-bde4-605e4d0fb337","expr":"keys != null","rationale":"The method uses the keys array to visit the lookup switch instruction, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:31.814517969Z"}
{"id":"1f3ab21a-7c67-41c5-9f6a-eaa28a0875a7","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"The labels array must be present to provide the jump targets for the lookup switch.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:31.814517969Z"}
{"id":"2d4b304c-7e05-45e3-995d-1e129c5cc7a7","expr":"keys.length == labels.length","rationale":"For each key there must be a corresponding label; the keys and labels arrays must be of equal length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:31.814517969Z"}
{"id":"6c3a8653-8119-42f2-af39-858919a16638","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"The default label for the switch must be non-null to direct control flow in unmatched cases.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:31.814517969Z"}
{"id":"723d2573-a971-4d2c-bba7-5dfc5119b792","expr":"keys.length >= 0 && labels.length >= 0","rationale":"Array lengths are by definition non-negative and valid to proceed with the instruction.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:31.814517969Z"}
{"id":"aadd0e94-2e65-4e4f-9523-6fa0cbd47721","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc is used as an argument in method calls which likely expect non-null strings for type description.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:32.066695653Z"}
{"id":"49e5329d-5dec-491a-b08a-5c6d4264d213","expr":"dims > 0","rationale":"dims represents number of dimensions in the multi-dimensional array instruction and should be positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:32.066695653Z"}
{"id":"36df1237-97bb-4ed7-91ae-9c6098aec511","expr":"desc.length() > 0","rationale":"desc should be a non-empty string describing the type of the array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:32.066695653Z"}
{"id":"eb911af6-7d62-455d-b5c0-950686234101","expr":"!desc.contains(\" \")","rationale":"desc as type descriptor likely will not include whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:32.066695653Z"}
{"id":"fea7261b-ea7d-4e49-870d-0db3281ffece","expr":"desc.startsWith(\"[\")","rationale":"A type descriptor for an array in JVM bytecode starts with '[' for the array type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:32.066695653Z"}
{"id":"7c400fe5-f1bb-4e9f-a3b2-eaace522b81b","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The variable name should be non-null to represent a valid local variable name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:32.213024488Z"}
