{"id":"f1462eb5-3e17-49a2-8f01-c001bfd1dc9e","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"Local variable indexes are typically non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:32.213024488Z"}
{"id":"e6dfac0e-97b0-49dd-8d9d-72d4620b90d2","expr":"line >= 0","rationale":"Line numbers in bytecode are non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:33.709559800Z"}
{"id":"c2808ed2-cc5c-4b6f-8d0d-3d7ebb116082","expr":"start != null","rationale":"Labels represent bytecode positions and are expected to be valid objects.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:33.709559800Z"}
{"id":"68a574d6-0cf3-45f4-acc7-eaea6ed98ef3","expr":"start != null","rationale":"The 'start' label represents the start of the try block and should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:34.146887051Z"}
