{"id":"b55effe5-dd6a-46d4-aeea-d36f0b7d369f","expr":"handler != null","rationale":"The 'handler' label specifies the start of the exception handler and must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:34.146887051Z"}
{"id":"8c19a200-de68-4ca6-acc2-8d02c97708c0","expr":"start != end","rationale":"The try block must span a non-zero range, so start and end labels differ.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:34.146887051Z"}
{"id":"c240c2d4-4f7e-4362-b63a-424828b9aceb","expr":"type == null || type.length() > 0","rationale":"The 'type' param is either null or a non-empty string, which conforms to the method contract.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:34.146887051Z"}
{"id":"e81b7567-d57b-4892-9967-9df4a874be82","expr":"(start != null && end != null && handler != null)","rationale":"visitTryCatchBlock is normally called with non-null start, end, and handler labels representing code ranges.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:34.762658202Z"}
{"id":"9d04ec5e-5758-43c2-83c8-9cfabd9dd37a","expr":"(start != null && end != null && start.getOffset() <= end.getOffset())","rationale":"In try-catch blocks, the start label should occur at or before the end label.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:34.762658202Z"}
{"id":"cfefd21e-e7d3-4528-9555-8e707def55a1","expr":"(handler != null)","rationale":"The handler label represents the catch block's entry point and thus should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:34.762658202Z"}
{"id":"7f0e0a7a-126b-4905-a127-73a932e420bf","expr":"(type == null || type.length() > 0)","rationale":"Type string indicates the exception type caught; it could be null to represent finally block or must be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:34.762658202Z"}
{"id":"5051e222-ac80-432c-b8d0-c0dfe94d6ef1","expr":"(start != null && end != null && handler != null && !(start.equals(end)))","rationale":"A try-catch block requires distinct start and end labels to represent a non-empty code region.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:34.762658202Z"}
{"id":"a90de957-2514-4c80-9aa3-d336461c6d08","expr":"maxStack >= 0","rationale":"The maximum stack size must be non-negative in bytecode.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:34.831467143Z"}
{"id":"25b3a8a2-e4ac-492e-bf78-405d3ca46827","expr":"maxLocals >= 0","rationale":"The maximum number of local variables must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:34.831467143Z"}
{"id":"02e1a1c5-b262-46d5-afe0-83a54af3ba0b","expr":"maxStack >= maxLocals","rationale":"In typical JVM usage, maxStack is often greater than or equal to maxLocals.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:34.831467143Z"}
{"id":"a585a28a-b3cb-43e5-a9e1-e6c6abc55418","expr":"name != null && desc != null && start != null && end != null","rationale":"The visitLocalVariable method in ASM usually requires non-null names, descriptors, and label ranges to describe the local variable correctly.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:35.668885576Z"}
{"id":"b2910e4f-dc05-4517-9617-7b0854c4ec9a","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"Local variable indexes represent the position in the local variable table and must be zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:35.668885576Z"}
{"id":"72d3f38c-8629-42fd-8bf2-56d86bd0fb69","expr":"!name.isEmpty()","rationale":"A local variable must have a valid name, so empty names are not expected here.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:35.668885576Z"}
{"id":"4b64343d-54e2-4576-a75b-e2184abe4ac3","expr":"start != end","rationale":"The variable's live range should span at least some code, implying start and end labels are different.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:35.668885576Z"}
{"id":"aaae15c6-f2e2-4d7a-9662-1b831bbee3c3","expr":"start != null","rationale":"The 'start' parameter generally represents a label marking a position in bytecode and is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:35.915957517Z"}
{"id":"ca77bb9c-0f64-46e4-b39b-106f78089784","expr":"line >= 0","rationale":"Line numbers in debugging information are always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:35.915957517Z"}
{"id":"891702a7-5801-4fee-a3cf-555849f9e2af","expr":"maxStack >= 0","rationale":"The maximum stack size for JVM bytecode should be zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:37.167985131Z"}
{"id":"8d8189cd-51fc-4166-8a8b-c78c5b6cae86","expr":"maxLocals >= 0","rationale":"The max locals count in bytecode cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:37.167985131Z"}
{"id":"24a04cd4-c4b1-42c9-ac3c-8557e8173190","expr":"maxLocals >= maxStack","rationale":"In many bytecode constructs, space for locals is at least as large as the max stack usage.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:37.167985131Z"}
{"id":"eaa9f042-9e70-4216-8159-46853659e2b2","expr":"maxLocals <= 65535","rationale":"JVM bytecode maximum local variables count is limited.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:37.167985131Z"}
{"id":"9b6f0685-c918-4f40-b28e-bacb415e6c78","expr":"maxStack <= 65535","rationale":"JVM limits max stack to 16-bit unsigned range.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:37.167985131Z"}
{"id":"b811197b-d9f1-45a9-b827-86ee7dd0e46f","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The desc parameter represents the annotation descriptor and should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:38.788707438Z"}
{"id":"ecc29f62-9363-4d64-9dbc-aa0023b33789","expr":"typeRef >= 0","rationale":"typeRef is defined as a non-negative integer identifier.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:38.788707438Z"}
{"id":"3a527805-a04c-4f7d-ba79-087da2352134","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"The visible flag indicates visibility and can only be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:38.788707438Z"}
{"id":"272ba510-8470-45b0-b173-fcd0cac0f21e","expr":"name == null || name.length() >= 0","rationale":"Name is either null or a non-negative length string, which is always true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:38.983362488Z"}
{"id":"5a04bc0a-725a-4a7f-854c-7607b58fae85","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access likely represents a flag or mask that is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:38.983362488Z"}
{"id":"e2c905c5-a4d7-49f7-a864-84ea80494e6d","expr":"access <= 0xFFFF","rationale":"Access flags generally fit within a 16-bit mask in bytecode manipulation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:38.983362488Z"}
{"id":"12a81e2f-ca0d-461d-8b5d-f05d60b4098b","expr":"name == null || !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"If name is not null, it is likely non-empty when passed to visitParameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:38.983362488Z"}
{"id":"9ed7670b-1c93-400a-956d-46394ac8a5d7","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The parameter 'name' is expected to be a valid String identifying the parameter name, so it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:39.496910869Z"}
{"id":"e4ade34f-0fe7-4349-ac56-33b23e5743b2","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"In JVM bytecode, access flags for parameters are represented by non-negative integers, indicating modifier bits.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:39.496910869Z"}
{"id":"2e096734-a235-488e-b29e-7ee3c8c3ae35","expr":"!name.isEmpty()","rationale":"A parameter name should not be empty; it is expected to be a valid identifier string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:39.496910869Z"}
{"id":"774e11c1-d801-44f1-b35e-afe3adbbfd47","expr":"Integer.bitCount(access) <= 6","rationale":"Typically, access flags use a limited number of bits, so the number of bits set is not excessively large.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:39.496910869Z"}
{"id":"bb0130ad-484c-4431-abd7-075c68d80017","expr":"access == (access & 0xFFFF)","rationale":"The access flags are expected to be a valid mask of recognized bits and fit within 16 bits.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:39.496910869Z"}
{"id":"607169b0-04f7-4acf-b2c1-fbb202d4edc7","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The name parameter represents the method name and is required.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:40.753416722Z"}
{"id":"bab42e40-bb2b-4165-bef4-d7b45d0d0fa1","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The descriptor parameter describes the method signature and is necessary.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:40.753416722Z"}
{"id":"9faef248-5cb7-42fc-b679-dd612536919c","expr":"bsm != null","rationale":"The bsm parameter is the bootstrap method handle for invokedynamic.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:40.753416722Z"}
{"id":"7f9f4c8d-9b3a-4ceb-b02d-fa249a38f0bd","expr":"bsmArgs == null || bsmArgs.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"Since bsmArgs represents variable arguments, it is either null or an array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:40.753416722Z"}
{"id":"fd2bdd26-9ea8-4b0b-8a28-6ae22ebbe335","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"Method names are typically non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:40.753416722Z"}
{"id":"b3f1cf03-aea3-492b-8297-c3ec8dd0e397","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The descriptor string for an annotation must be non-null to identify the annotation type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:40.928842253Z"}
{"id":"ab836bf0-3164-48c5-ac2b-da7a9b6ed416","expr":"typePath == null || typePath.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"If the TypePath is non-null, its length must be at least zero indicating a valid path or empty path.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:40.928842253Z"}
{"id":"c333f49c-2f1a-4f00-886d-58a6b1f13dd6","expr":"typeRef >= 0","rationale":"The typeRef is an integer indicating location/type info and must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:40.928842253Z"}
{"id":"de5a8c3b-3fed-47d4-b194-2b11a7e17d3a","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a combined AnnotationVisitor from two non-null visitors, so result should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:41.029719572Z"}
{"id":"1929adbd-4b33-44ba-a740-1b1cc5331d72","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method parameter 'name' is expected to be non-null when this method is called.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:41.529305171Z"}
{"id":"e3b34b72-9303-4c5d-9576-ce5734dd243d","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The method descriptor is required and should be a non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:41.529305171Z"}
{"id":"f3fb5076-dfbd-43fe-8187-1d15d6422e9c","expr":"bsm != null","rationale":"The bootstrap method handle is essential for the invokedynamic instruction and is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:41.529305171Z"}
{"id":"b0920d8e-3977-42ce-af91-b9e13e84500b","expr":"bsmArgs == null || bsmArgs.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"The bsmArgs parameter is varargs and should be an array of Objects if not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:22:41.529305171Z"}
