{"id":"400b7c2b-ac64-4831-b876-56f2dc846a4c","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"Since getstatic emits a GETSTATIC bytecode for a field owned by 'owner', 'owner' should be a valid Type instance, hence not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getstatic(Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:24:57.545470233Z"}
{"id":"478e8b2e-6009-43fc-bf9d-0399e7dab3a5","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The field name passed to getstatic must be valid and typically non-empty to identify the field.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getstatic(Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:24:57.545470233Z"}
{"id":"c27f9779-90ad-4e9e-bee4-1dd22701f335","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The field's type to be loaded by getstatic must be specified and cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getstatic(Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:24:57.545470233Z"}
{"id":"d9b6c9a4-e923-49d1-8127-5182e752a47c","expr":"type.isArray() == false || owner.isArray() == false","rationale":"It's unlikely the owner or field type are both arrays simultaneously for a static field; however, this might depend on the context but can be a useful invariant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getstatic(Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:24:57.545470233Z"}
{"id":"f98e291f-c5f9-4d56-8286-55d7b5659a3c","expr":"(owner.isPrimitive() == false)","rationale":"The owner of a static field must be a class or interface type, not a primitive type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getstatic(Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:24:57.545470233Z"}
{"id":"ef1904d5-7dac-4ab2-8415-d3388a2247f6","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"emit_field would require a non-null owner Type to identify the field's class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getstatic(Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:24:57.983124170Z"}
