{"id":"b1226a29-ea93-4c19-bf5f-bc7fba479991","expr":"type.isPrimitive() || !type.isPrimitive()","rationale":"type must be a valid Type object, which can be primitive or not; this expression is trivially true but shows type is valid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#putfield(Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:24:58.311944756Z"}
