{"id":"16b5d81a-13d4-4ad4-be01-89364456f3b9","expr":"obj.getClass().isAssignableFrom(obj.getClass())","rationale":"Object should be of some class compatible with the class on which the proxy will invoke the super method; although trivially true here, shows the intention of type assignments and no type mismatch","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#invokeSuper(Object,Object[]):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:37.378262158Z"}
