{"id":"708e7658-d256-4ea4-80d4-7f1e3e4f240b","expr":"callbackTypes != null","rationale":"The method uses callbackTypes.length and accesses its elements, so it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:38.153993234Z"}
{"id":"ed5f3ca1-3169-45dc-b6e1-f77cbc240c8f","expr":"callbackTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"The length of the callbackTypes array is non-negative by definition.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:38.153993234Z"}
{"id":"b5ba1e06-ca81-40b2-9d33-bec279720364","expr":"(!checkAll || callbackTypes.length > 0)","rationale":"If checkAll is true, it implies we expect some callback types to be present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:38.153993234Z"}
{"id":"2b3c39ac-8586-482f-a3b9-371f8d7224eb","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns a Type array, it should always return non-null array even if input callbackTypes is null or empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:38.929633489Z"}
{"id":"ef7b762c-5d23-4064-8c45-6af756a41bed","expr":"(callbackTypes == null || callbackTypes.length == 0) || (result.length == callbackTypes.length)","rationale":"The size of the returned Type array usually corresponds to the input class array length, unless input is null or empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:38.929633489Z"}
{"id":"322a00f9-d2b6-424a-b36a-a8557b8432d8","expr":"callbackTypes == null || result.length == callbackTypes.length","rationale":"Ensures that whenever callbackTypes is provided, result array size matches it.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:38.929633489Z"}
{"id":"ceb4c667-b7f6-4f39-8392-66ceb0460310","expr":"result != null && result.length >= 0","rationale":"An array length can't be negative and result should always be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:38.929633489Z"}
{"id":"00e4f07e-57cc-4db1-945f-85529d88873f","expr":"result.length == callbackTypes.length","rationale":"The method creates a 'types' array of the same length as 'callbackTypes' and fills it with types corresponding elementwise.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:40.031433625Z"}
{"id":"20befaca-79d3-4f83-8cad-5267362c7b08","expr":"checkAll == false || result != null","rationale":"While the method always initializes an array, this invariant is more general about checkAll's effect.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:40.031433625Z"}
{"id":"a312e79d-a215-4c7c-b759-352924ea0ba3","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Result should never be null, it should represent the types corresponding to the callbacks input.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:41.399938200Z"}
{"id":"afaae6e8-7f6b-4dce-b361-b01faa2abc8a","expr":"(callbacks == null || callbacks.length == 0) == (result.length == 0)","rationale":"Empty or null input callbacks lead to empty result array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:41.399938200Z"}
{"id":"4cf6fc95-335e-4fd1-889a-933585088bbd","expr":"result.length == (callbacks == null ? 0 : callbacks.length)","rationale":"The result array is one-to-one mapped to the input callbacks.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:41.399938200Z"}
{"id":"ee805173-85e4-4cac-bead-0dd939fa4ee8","expr":"result != null && result.length >= 0","rationale":"Basic invariant about an array result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:41.399938200Z"}
{"id":"562b515f-e804-4697-a070-611c3e62ae5e","expr":"callbacks != null || result.length == 0","rationale":"If callbacks null, result must be empty array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:41.399938200Z"}
{"id":"ed91bb07-56a4-4c09-954c-3e0211ae9c78","expr":"result.length == callbacks.length","rationale":"The method creates a result array with the same length as callbacks and fills it correspondingly.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:41.479046170Z"}
{"id":"953194de-fee4-4f9d-9dcb-feb0ffa41657","expr":"(!checkAll || result != null)","rationale":"The result array is always non-null regardless of checkAll.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:41.479046170Z"}
{"id":"d9c2b093-b228-4368-98e7-c751ee7cfd11","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Given the implementation creates a new Type array, result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:41.479046170Z"}
{"id":"aa2bfee6-adae-45cf-8b51-1f671f568230","expr":"callbacks.length == 0 || result[0] != null","rationale":"The method maps each callback to a Type, so if the array is non-empty the first element should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:41.479046170Z"}
{"id":"a3f3fb4b-a60d-431b-8815-0d57a8d5c98b","expr":"callbacks == null || callbacks.length >= 0","rationale":"If callbacks is not null, it is an array and thus its length is >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:41.686350340Z"}
{"id":"86c163b3-8d58-4b5e-85bc-e6d585bed390","expr":"callbacks != null || callbacks == null","rationale":"Callbacks parameter might be null or not.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:41.686350340Z"}
{"id":"68bfb2d8-f5ed-4caf-806a-1e57005f3b66","expr":"callbacks != null || true","rationale":"Indicates that callbacks can be null or non-null; the method handles either case.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:41.686350340Z"}
{"id":"54b4e637-5fee-44a2-89e1-abe37e66dc14","expr":"callbacks != null","rationale":"The method iterates over callbacks array, so callbacks should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:41.818847862Z"}
{"id":"bf8c78bf-551f-429e-a55c-263b4045a61f","expr":"callbacks.length >= 0","rationale":"The length of the callbacks array must be zero or more.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:41.818847862Z"}
{"id":"839b8deb-8a29-4149-acb3-e277ce983f04","expr":"!checkAll || callbacks.length > 0","rationale":"If checkAll is true, it implies there is something to check, so callbacks length should be greater than zero.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:41.818847862Z"}
{"id":"fb32cf3d-6761-4928-ad0e-c59548729a1a","expr":"callbackTypes != null","rationale":"The method expects a non-null array of Types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:42.778603008Z"}
{"id":"f020fdfa-4505-4a20-ae22-5a8189f2f215","expr":"callbackTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:42.778603008Z"}
{"id":"7651676c-b5d2-46d4-806c-f72d62d8071a","expr":"callbackTypes.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"The input parameter is an array of Type objects.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:42.778603008Z"}
{"id":"5de4abed-8a8b-4b85-8107-060b65bb4992","expr":"callbackTypes.length == (callbackTypes == null ? 0 : callbackTypes.length)","rationale":"Length does not change at this program point.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:42.778603008Z"}
{"id":"9e567e42-f6b2-4595-bd1e-a45e2a4f430e","expr":"result != null && result.length == (callbackTypes == null ? 0 : callbackTypes.length)","rationale":"The returned array length matches the input callbackTypes array length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:43.382738206Z"}
{"id":"0c29e0e3-180d-4b9c-b59a-3a3ed39bbc6d","expr":"callbackTypes == null || (result.length == callbackTypes.length)","rationale":"If callbackTypes is not null, result length equals callbackTypes length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:43.382738206Z"}
{"id":"87e0ccce-bba5-4713-b461-3a9204c88b7a","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a non-null array even if the input is null (empty array).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:43.382738206Z"}
{"id":"5a19519c-43b6-4073-a710-4ca7c7014ec5","expr":"callbackType != null","rationale":"The method throws IllegalStateException if callbackType is null or unrecognized; thus, callbackType must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:43.958880285Z"}
{"id":"2edd814f-191c-4a51-8713-fc6d470ace88","expr":"checkAll == true || checkAll == false","rationale":"Boolean checkAll can only be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:43.958880285Z"}
{"id":"e4cc8d1a-ce6e-4b3d-a536-ebade69f93f2","expr":"callbackType.isAssignableFrom(callbackType)","rationale":"Class objects are always assignable from themselves.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:43.958880285Z"}
{"id":"2bb132c9-b1a0-4fa8-8793-5457b69b6741","expr":"!(callbackType == null)","rationale":"Ensures safe evaluation of callbackType before method execution.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:43.958880285Z"}
{"id":"4bcc0d18-7c8d-492c-bd22-25d955badcb9","expr":"callback != null","rationale":"In the method body, the first statement throws an IllegalStateException if callback is null, so at method entry callback is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:45.125085269Z"}
{"id":"583e6321-c1be-4135-9f71-3e5ae2c7d192","expr":"checkAll == true || checkAll == false","rationale":"checkAll is a boolean parameter, so valid values are only true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:45.125085269Z"}
{"id":"ddd1b676-9f72-458e-833a-f6e53d694ccf","expr":"callback.getClass() != null","rationale":"Since callback is non-null, calling getClass() is safe and returns a non-null Class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:45.125085269Z"}
{"id":"efe3dd2a-6144-4b73-9df6-c420a924b2b7","expr":"!checkAll || (checkAll == true)","rationale":"checkAll being boolean means !checkAll or checkAll is always true.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:45.125085269Z"}
{"id":"f5e9d764-c2d3-4e2a-aaa3-7d51ee0b4571","expr":"callbackType != null","rationale":"The method matches callbackType with entries in CALLBACKS, so callbackType must be non-null to be meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:45.464043680Z"}
{"id":"58bbb677-0e18-4524-8350-381532b00c58","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since determineType returns a Type based on the callback's class and this method does not return null, result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:45.762628951Z"}
{"id":"f70ef900-7592-48ba-931c-a4b5d26ca6f2","expr":"!checkAll || (result != null)","rationale":"If checkAll is true, the method returns a valid Type; if false, no additional constraints, but result remains consistent.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:45.762628951Z"}
{"id":"65c8bab2-972a-420c-aaca-8da732f15e2d","expr":"ce != null && context != null && methods != null && !methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"Since the method iterates over 'methods', it must be non-null and likely contains elements.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:46.725881814Z"}
{"id":"406bceca-fd76-49b9-8f21-51257304b827","expr":"methods.iterator() != null","rationale":"Calling iterator() on 'methods' provides a non-null iterator.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:46.725881814Z"}
{"id":"9456594f-d994-41cf-bd28-b8e5bbc3865c","expr":"ce.getClass() != null && context.getClass() != null && methods.getClass() != null","rationale":"The base objects 'ce', 'context', and 'methods' are non-null and valid objects.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:46.725881814Z"}
{"id":"4b1aee00-2b86-4595-888d-a147d9b4a3cf","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method either returns a Type found or throws an exception if none is found, so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:46.810936521Z"}
{"id":"6419ec78-8535-4fef-97b8-259be8caffbe","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method throws an exception if the callback type is unknown, the returned result is always a non-null CallbackGenerator.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:47.003418344Z"}
{"id":"39e9eb44-8b15-4ce4-a78c-6c0c8f8357aa","expr":"methods != null && !methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method iterates over methods list, so it must be non-null and not empty upon method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:47.131402373Z"}
{"id":"d0dbf224-314f-48dc-b121-598516f84e32","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"ClassEmitter ce is a parameter used throughout the method, and must be non-null to operate.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:47.131402373Z"}
{"id":"d2cf8699-5c07-4a63-97bc-f832771a8f04","expr":"context != null","rationale":"Context context is used extensively and is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:47.131402373Z"}
{"id":"a9f4f723-5799-47ca-85f9-49c5dd81c81a","expr":"e != null","rationale":"The CodeEmitter e is expected to be a valid emitter instance for code generation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:47.765101183Z"}
{"id":"ba7f2b1f-eb6a-4b9b-b109-283f2d726c7d","expr":"context != null","rationale":"The Context context must be present to provide contextual information for code generation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:47.765101183Z"}
{"id":"e9c3e69b-d874-4100-9d4f-c373c4d499b0","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The methods list must be initialized to provide the methods to process.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:47.765101183Z"}
{"id":"c371f175-930d-4519-bf6d-53ce583f5e8e","expr":"methods.isEmpty() == false","rationale":"Typically, the method is called with a non-empty method list to generate code for.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:47.765101183Z"}
{"id":"0334e138-6700-4c72-b223-08031d9b77a0","expr":"methods.iterator().hasNext() == true","rationale":"The iterator of methods must have at least one element for the loop to execute as per implementation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:47.765101183Z"}
{"id":"e90764d9-26b9-4c13-98bb-7bb37b2ac2ab","expr":"impl != null","rationale":"impl must not be null to avoid NullPointerException when calling impl.getName()","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:48.416590769Z"}
{"id":"8384cd6f-44fe-49cf-ad13-fef2c5f90b15","expr":"impl.getName() != null","rationale":"impl.getName() is expected to be non-null to properly concatenate with \"$Method\"","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:48.416590769Z"}
{"id":"ba6a6df3-34ec-4bad-b526-5130e4a613bc","expr":"!impl.getName().isEmpty()","rationale":"Typically, method signatures have non-empty names, so impl.getName() is not empty","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:48.416590769Z"}
{"id":"ebaddbd0-bacf-41b1-abd9-ddf4b868fc5d","expr":"impl.getName().indexOf('$') == -1","rationale":"Dollar sign is appended to the method field name; original method name typically does not contain it to avoid ambiguity","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:48.416590769Z"}
{"id":"212adea4-f125-4d73-98d3-0618a4719fd0","expr":"impl != null","rationale":"The parameter impl must not be null for the method to execute safely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:48.985547415Z"}
{"id":"31a57cf2-2e94-4789-a976-96e1fcc44a30","expr":"impl.getName() != null","rationale":"The name retrieved from impl is not null since concatenation with \"$Proxy\" is valid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:48.985547415Z"}
{"id":"eedf644b-af1b-4986-80db-51d3886b8146","expr":"impl.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"Impl's name is expected to be a non-empty string to form a valid proxy field name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:48.985547415Z"}
{"id":"f2d1285a-6053-4f8c-82a5-e98ed8558bd6","expr":"methods != null && !methods.contains(null)","rationale":"The method iterates over methods assuming non-null elements; thus methods should not contain null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:48.987736554Z"}
{"id":"204b2239-d1ee-4beb-b974-e7e73b0724e8","expr":"context != null","rationale":"Method uses context methods without null checks so context is expected non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:48.987736554Z"}
{"id":"0d03c22b-509a-4086-b681-a1bcd6f4414f","expr":"e != null","rationale":"CodeEmitter e is dereferenced multiple times, so must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:48.987736554Z"}
{"id":"151baa1c-6fee-4043-8cfc-5f6fc3de31df","expr":"methods.isEmpty() || e.getClass().isAssignableFrom(e.getClass())","rationale":"This is a trivial invariant, mainly e and methods must be consistently usable.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:48.987736554Z"}
{"id":"384d3dde-f2e9-4ad2-afdd-b5e10b947e54","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The concatenation of impl.getName() and \"$Proxy\" is never null","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:49.684254962Z"}
{"id":"79a25267-f0bc-4575-9c4f-7e8960817474","expr":"result.startsWith(impl.getName())","rationale":"The result string always begins with the impl signature's name","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:49.684254962Z"}
{"id":"96cbbf05-8d3e-40d3-8247-2911ee8b8515","expr":"impl.getName().length() + 6 == result.length()","rationale":"Length of result is length of impl.getName() plus length of \"$Proxy\"","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:49.684254962Z"}
{"id":"781a4c47-0824-4585-95d2-c1972005b4c1","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"The ClassEmitter 'ce' is expected to be non-null for method code emission.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:50.424696677Z"}
{"id":"ab64c1df-8ba6-48e2-8cd8-5aec97a21db4","expr":"context != null","rationale":"The 'context' parameter must be non-null for generating method bodies.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:50.424696677Z"}
{"id":"78a86a19-962b-463a-afa4-a185a1bfb3ef","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The 'methods' parameter represents the methods to generate proxies for and should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:50.424696677Z"}
{"id":"a54ac106-cdeb-47b8-8e95-e36fb3659b5a","expr":"methods.size() >= 0","rationale":"The size of 'methods' list should never be negative by definition.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:50.424696677Z"}
{"id":"67654ff0-9709-4ff5-a74a-e5070c94c0ed","expr":"e != null && method != null && context != null","rationale":"Method parameters are typically non-null when method is invoked.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#superHelper(CodeEmitter,MethodInfo,Context):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:50.586427568Z"}
{"id":"6753d40d-aae0-433f-8dfa-0e36b6d76bca","expr":"method.getModifiers() >= 0","rationale":"Method modifiers are bitflags and non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#superHelper(CodeEmitter,MethodInfo,Context):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:50.586427568Z"}
{"id":"ce44b85e-7b0e-4847-a124-3f308d79a4ef","expr":"context != null","rationale":"Context parameter is expected to be non-null for correct method execution.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#superHelper(CodeEmitter,MethodInfo,Context):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:50.586427568Z"}
{"id":"85c97377-2914-4825-99e8-9c40214ad71b","expr":"e != null","rationale":"CodeEmitter parameter must be non-null to perform code emission operations.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:52.083492799Z"}
{"id":"1a67046a-6591-4b25-9678-ee353e01435a","expr":"context != null","rationale":"Context parameter is required and expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:52.083492799Z"}
{"id":"f4a0a971-acdf-4d1a-987c-d667d70dfe8a","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The list of methods must exist to be processed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:52.083492799Z"}
{"id":"3cf3d9d9-02e1-4779-b99b-fbd9dc9eb2a3","expr":"methods != null && !methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"The generate method iterates over 'methods' to declare fields and generate methods, so 'methods' must be non-null and contain elements at exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:52.728437961Z"}
{"id":"86c0caee-a329-468c-840a-09d712df1c5d","expr":"context != null","rationale":"The method uses 'context' to get implementation signatures and to start code emission; it can't be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:26:52.728437961Z"}
