{"id":"0aa7c88e-f6da-4dda-95f3-83e6f8eefe21","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is boolean, thus can only be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:03.523524821Z"}
{"id":"d193c1b6-10f3-449a-b6b2-5764029660cc","expr":"descriptor.length() > 0","rationale":"Descriptors are normally non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:03.523524821Z"}
{"id":"4ec4b70c-0ba4-4648-ba1d-016b9d1a14e6","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns newly created AnnotationWriter which is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:03.674066751Z"}
{"id":"08de2514-ac30-426a-bcd3-633b67616ffa","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The method uses 'descriptor' to create a constant class symbol, so it should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:04.374867381Z"}
{"id":"e777a30f-7a03-40fb-9620-118f9ca9af1c","expr":"numDimensions > 0","rationale":"The method puts numDimensions as a byte after the instruction. numDimensions should be positive to be valid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:04.374867381Z"}
{"id":"e26b8b86-6887-4fa7-9c4b-3cc61e9afbf9","expr":"descriptor.startsWith(\"[\")","rationale":"Given the descriptor is for a multi-dimensional array, it should start with '['.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:04.374867381Z"}
{"id":"e248c1de-96b2-4217-8b7b-5e6cd3c03abb","expr":"numDimensions <= descriptor.lastIndexOf('[') + 1","rationale":"The number of dimensions must be consistent with the descriptor's array dimension prefix count.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:04.374867381Z"}
{"id":"a37aef11-5def-4572-93fc-5d25133f9423","expr":"numDimensions < 256","rationale":"numDimensions is stored with putByte, so it is constrained to a byte size.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:04.374867381Z"}
