{"id":"06f4cb14-98ce-402b-9520-8566006c581a","expr":"result >= 6","rationale":"The method either returns 6 + sourceLength if copying, or at least 8 otherwise plus attributes sizes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#computeMethodInfoSize():int","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:30.383519137Z"}
{"id":"f94c3e56-1b07-44af-bacd-d078d5304700","expr":"result % 2 == 0","rationale":"Method info size is generally aligned and even due to bytecode and headers sizes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#computeMethodInfoSize():int","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:30.383519137Z"}
{"id":"ca9a34ec-e094-4758-87fa-a4e445a10709","expr":"result >= 8","rationale":"The method info structure base size is at least 8 bytes if not copied.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#computeMethodInfoSize():int","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:30.383519137Z"}
{"id":"527b043e-3345-40c6-8b9c-0415e62c8ece","expr":"result < Integer.MAX_VALUE","rationale":"The returned size must be representable as an int and exception is thrown if code length is too large.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#computeMethodInfoSize():int","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:30.383519137Z"}
{"id":"c74e66b1-bec0-40b2-84da-9a7ab22dcb6d","expr":"output != null","rationale":"The 'output' ByteVector parameter must be non-null before writing method info.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#putMethodInfo(ByteVector):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:31.105616581Z"}
{"id":"128e1657-87f2-4102-90b1-06d252e83d67","expr":"output != null","rationale":"output must be non-null because the method writes data into it.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#putMethodInfo(ByteVector):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:31.161647367Z"}
{"id":"1952750a-9d19-4f37-8987-c854b1ef20c9","expr":"output.length >= 0","rationale":"The length field of ByteVector should always be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#putMethodInfo(ByteVector):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:31.161647367Z"}
{"id":"dc1ee4a8-369f-4e05-97a7-46acfcfc4c0c","expr":"output.data != null","rationale":"The internal byte array of the ByteVector must be non-null after writing.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#putMethodInfo(ByteVector):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:31.161647367Z"}
{"id":"08803638-012a-4702-8725-4f9c825ca67b","expr":"output.length <= output.data.length","rationale":"The length of stored data in ByteVector must not exceed the size of the data buffer.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#putMethodInfo(ByteVector):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:31.161647367Z"}
{"id":"99740e4a-8f8b-43db-a7b5-e97f119eedad","expr":"output.length > 0","rationale":"At method exit, the ByteVector must have had some bytes written to it to represent method_info.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#putMethodInfo(ByteVector):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:31.161647367Z"}
{"id":"850a225c-c189-4eea-b733-c23ed837b5f4","expr":"methodInfoOffset >= 0","rationale":"Method info offset must be non-negative as it denotes a byte offset in the class reader.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#setMethodAttributesSource(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:31.485575781Z"}
{"id":"cabc2608-b6a9-423c-84e0-4be576cf1ffe","expr":"methodInfoLength >= 6","rationale":"The methodInfoLength is at least 6 because the method implementation subtracts 6 from it for sourceLength.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#setMethodAttributesSource(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:31.485575781Z"}
{"id":"1cb44539-5f5f-4193-89d1-9013619cfe9e","expr":"methodInfoLength >= 0","rationale":"The methodInfoLength is a length measure that should always be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#setMethodAttributesSource(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:31.485575781Z"}
{"id":"31753486-6543-4813-862c-0d28050c2d7e","expr":"methodInfoOffset + 6 <= methodInfoOffset + methodInfoLength","rationale":"After adding 6 to methodInfoOffset, the sourceOffset stays within the bounds of method info.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#setMethodAttributesSource(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:31.485575781Z"}
{"id":"547a5c13-a2b1-45f6-a85b-3830ded4a5cd","expr":"attributePrototypes != null","rationale":"The passed attributePrototypes must be non-null because the method calls addAttributes on it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#collectAttributePrototypes(Attribute.Set):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:31.500923332Z"}
{"id":"9d3db8f1-320e-4b3d-ad09-9b2614352298","expr":"attributePrototypes.isEmpty() || !attributePrototypes.isEmpty()","rationale":"The attributePrototypes set is ready to be added attributes, with no further restrictions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#collectAttributePrototypes(Attribute.Set):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:31.500923332Z"}
{"id":"b223b71d-a792-45d6-87d6-1618fc8bb4ae","expr":"attributePrototypes.toArray() != null","rationale":"The attributePrototypes internal state is accessible through toArray without null issues.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#collectAttributePrototypes(Attribute.Set):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:31.500923332Z"}
{"id":"3e9b51aa-3e19-4101-915e-581c8cbec148","expr":"attributePrototypes.contains(null) == false","rationale":"The attributePrototypes set likely does not contain null attributes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#collectAttributePrototypes(Attribute.Set):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:31.500923332Z"}
{"id":"93a98823-a95e-42fe-b04e-260a0914caec","expr":"attributePrototypes != null","rationale":"The method uses attributePrototypes by calling addAttributes without null check, so attributePrototypes must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#collectAttributePrototypes(Attribute.Set):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:32.290195944Z"}
{"id":"510fb020-c4a5-4dd3-8fb3-531e4acdb537","expr":"source == null || source.length() > 0","rationale":"The source may be null or a non-empty string representing source file name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:34.401408304Z"}
{"id":"6634f72d-d915-4464-af1b-a2354a7583ec","expr":"debug == null || debug.length() >= 0","rationale":"Debug info is optional and can be empty or have length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:34.401408304Z"}
{"id":"a49a3049-7ee7-438d-9a9c-deb0c138443a","expr":"(source == null) || (debug != null || debug == null)","rationale":"No direct dependency between source and debug but both might be independently null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:34.401408304Z"}
{"id":"861de6a4-feaa-4857-9b72-7c5ece242d90","expr":"source != null || debug == null || true","rationale":"No specific relationship is required here.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:34.401408304Z"}
{"id":"c5669fcf-787b-4b17-affa-65e22d3e5ae2","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The name parameter represents the fully qualified name of a module and should not be null to identify the module correctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitModule(String,int,String):ModuleVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.227001251Z"}
{"id":"0b100850-9c2f-46f3-8b27-9cc43ce55a64","expr":"version == null || version.length() > 0","rationale":"The version string is allowed to be null or a non-empty module version string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitModule(String,int,String):ModuleVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.227001251Z"}
{"id":"0d9fa9d3-d6dc-4aa4-9658-1811aacd0786","expr":"name.isEmpty() == false","rationale":"The module name should be a valid non-empty string representing the module's name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitModule(String,int,String):ModuleVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.227001251Z"}
{"id":"0af9c0a2-9129-47cd-aa8e-48e5fc3fdfcc","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access flags are generally non-negative integers representing bit flags.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitModule(String,int,String):ModuleVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.227001251Z"}
{"id":"385b9427-b1f1-49d7-b1e2-6116ee011ae5","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The internal name of the class should be non-null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.260850503Z"}
{"id":"66a838d9-bd87-49bc-bdf2-bd815b525fcc","expr":"interfaces == null || interfaces.length >= 0","rationale":"interfaces may be null or hold zero or more interface names.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.260850503Z"}
{"id":"284ef4d7-9c54-4d1d-b2ff-8c98ad5ab519","expr":"version >>> 16 >= 45","rationale":"The class version major number is stored in the upper 16 bits and should be at least 45.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.260850503Z"}
{"id":"ddd3e187-bc3f-464e-8d99-731655e7a7c2","expr":"result == null || name != null","rationale":"If the returned ModuleVisitor is not null, the name parameter passed to visitModule is likely not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitModule(String,int,String):ModuleVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.411574217Z"}
{"id":"dc032199-1804-4274-bff7-bcbebaf688f8","expr":"version == null || result != null","rationale":"If version is non-null, an interest in visiting module (non-null result) is more likely.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitModule(String,int,String):ModuleVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.411574217Z"}
{"id":"a4a7597d-415c-41be-a66c-759bf8f30181","expr":"name.length() > 0 || result == null","rationale":"Name is likely a non-empty string if a ModuleVisitor is returned, otherwise result is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitModule(String,int,String):ModuleVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.411574217Z"}
{"id":"edef7fe6-06d1-4d80-bbd0-6417a9aa280d","expr":"source == null || source.length() > 0","rationale":"The source string, if present, is likely a filename or source information that is rarely empty if non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.765394638Z"}
{"id":"58ba669f-8dd9-414c-9949-e986de9e83a0","expr":"debug == null || debug.length() >= 0","rationale":"The debug parameter is allowed to be null or any string length, including empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.765394638Z"}
{"id":"5f5e42fd-546b-41e3-a928-26ecbe1a15ec","expr":"source != null || debug == null || debug.length() >= 0","rationale":"There is no direct dependency imposed between source and debug.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.765394638Z"}
{"id":"6d47ac45-c9aa-4abb-8479-7ff2ee5b079e","expr":"source == null || debug == null || !debug.isEmpty() || debug.isEmpty()","rationale":"Debug information is optional and can be empty or non-empty regardless of source.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.765394638Z"}
{"id":"aac96fe2-40fb-4a20-aafa-df9506eb5bf3","expr":"source == null || debug == null || true","rationale":"No strong invariant directly connects source and debug; they can be independently null or non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.765394638Z"}
{"id":"698fd418-0f69-43f2-890b-2ad62ddf4a3f","expr":"nestHost != null","rationale":"The method expects a valid internal name representing the nest host, so it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestHost(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.889199321Z"}
{"id":"516fc9bc-f74d-4e24-ac38-8f0507e31da1","expr":"nestHost.length() > 0","rationale":"Since nestHost is the internal name of a class, it should be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestHost(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.889199321Z"}
{"id":"8d945492-1df4-4db1-85f1-bf66498d5b90","expr":"!nestHost.contains(\".\")","rationale":"Internal names use slash separators, so 'nestHost' is expected not to contain '.' characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestHost(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:35.889199321Z"}
{"id":"9a26c671-465a-4156-9be4-f1b33b595117","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The internal name of the class must be provided for the visit.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:36.099741375Z"}
{"id":"0fc1c391-4d66-4a52-9f29-6a85204a8b67","expr":"(interfaces == null || interfaces.length >= 0)","rationale":"interfaces is either null or a valid array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:36.099741375Z"}
{"id":"604c68b3-c47d-4b19-ac66-1148fd964ea6","expr":"(signature == null || signature.length() >= 0)","rationale":"signature is either null or a valid string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:36.099741375Z"}
{"id":"cbaf7b98-ec99-4cbb-a151-c56d1338fd4a","expr":"version >= 0","rationale":"The version number must be non-negative as per class file specification.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:36.099741375Z"}
{"id":"d2c9de7e-0147-45c5-a2c4-80c37b4cd256","expr":"nestHost != null && nestHost.length() > 0","rationale":"The parameter nestHost typically identifies the internal name of a class which should be non-null and non-empty if visitNestHost is called.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestHost(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:38.447971601Z"}
{"id":"d1815c8c-1058-4fc7-9f90-2a67ccf1511e","expr":"nestHost.indexOf('/') < 0","rationale":"In ASM, internal names use slashes, so it's typical for nestHost to have '/' characters but this invariant assumes it does not contain slashes indicating it could be a simple name or a certain condition at exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestHost(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:38.447971601Z"}
{"id":"cfbd3500-246a-466d-a9f8-8a2c2a869aa3","expr":"nestHost.equals(nestHost.trim())","rationale":"Ensures that nestHost does not have extraneous leading or trailing white space which would be unexpected in an internal name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestHost(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:38.447971601Z"}
{"id":"b827e6c2-d168-4297-af4c-bc51c053bae3","expr":"nestHost.indexOf('\\0') < 0","rationale":"It's unlikely that a class internal name contains null characters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestHost(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:38.447971601Z"}
{"id":"35a99652-d3c8-4dcb-8ed5-5613d02874f9","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"Owner should be non-null as it represents the internal name of the enclosing class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:38.734474065Z"}
{"id":"c607f5aa-ca59-49cd-a6ef-b8137dc0feb9","expr":"(name == null) || (!name.isEmpty())","rationale":"Name can be null if the class is not enclosed in a method, otherwise it should not be empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:38.734474065Z"}
{"id":"60a56857-8c31-457a-8098-f890d2571d1d","expr":"(descriptor == null) || descriptor.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"The descriptor, if not null, should be a method descriptor starting with '('.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:38.734474065Z"}
{"id":"adcc6cdb-d4ef-43dc-80ce-5925128b2aa3","expr":"owner.length() > 0","rationale":"Owner is an internal class name and should not be empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:38.734474065Z"}
{"id":"13bab3b4-f373-4d63-a518-762c249db8e3","expr":"name == null || descriptor != null","rationale":"If there is a name enclosing method, descriptor must not be null since it describes the method signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:38.734474065Z"}
{"id":"57f96fb7-134a-4b9c-9734-ab38891bcecd","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"Annotations must have a descriptor; null descriptor is not meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:39.020179696Z"}
{"id":"725e5ed5-483d-4aca-a2e3-b4230ad98c2c","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a primitive boolean, thus always either true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:39.020179696Z"}
{"id":"15bca3cb-d90f-44ff-b9a6-2c0f86a41894","expr":"(descriptor.length() > 2)","rationale":"Valid descriptor length for proper class descriptor format.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:39.020179696Z"}
{"id":"792cdbad-95da-4265-bfda-d34a253aaaee","expr":"typeRef >>> 24 == 0x13 || typeRef >>> 24 == 0x14 || typeRef >>> 24 == 0x15","rationale":"The typeRef should be one of the recognized type reference sorts for class type annotations (e.g., CLASS_TYPE_PARAMETER(0x13), CLASS_TYPE_PARAMETER_BOUND(0x14), CLASS_EXTENDS(0x15)).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:39.767623112Z"}
{"id":"7c3e02a4-32cc-493b-bf7e-d9bc63c2fe1a","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"The visible flag is a simple boolean indicating the runtime visibility of the annotation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:39.767623112Z"}
{"id":"1964b18c-6da7-4dc9-9868-3723c51ad8b8","expr":"typeRef >= 0","rationale":"Type reference int should be non-negative as it encodes information in its bits.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:39.767623112Z"}
{"id":"75c5bed4-dd6b-4d64-b33e-7eff90e21f2f","expr":"(result == null) || (descriptor != null && result != null)","rationale":"If the result is non-null, descriptor is expected to be non-null as it is passed to the delegate visitAnnotation call.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:39.821804660Z"}
{"id":"b361a689-ed62-413e-8228-d74f32ccfca5","expr":"(result == null) || (result.getClass() != null)","rationale":"If the result is not null, its class is naturally non-null. This is a basic sanity for the returned AnnotationVisitor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:39.821804660Z"}
{"id":"83f7637b-8db7-405a-8aac-c49040c24af6","expr":"owner != null && !owner.isEmpty()","rationale":"The 'owner' parameter typically holds the internal name of the enclosing class, which should be a non-null and non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:40.223444647Z"}
{"id":"c634022b-2335-4de4-a3c7-c2a9863f8ff6","expr":"name == null || (!name.isEmpty() && descriptor != null && !descriptor.isEmpty())","rationale":"If 'name' is non-null, then it is expected that 'descriptor' is also non-null and both are non-empty, representing the method name and descriptor of the enclosing method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:40.223444647Z"}
{"id":"26a5c2d7-efc9-493c-b4d1-d7d2ea0e93a0","expr":"(name == null && descriptor == null) || (name != null && descriptor != null)","rationale":"The method's name and descriptor should be consistent; if one is null, the other likely is as well.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:40.223444647Z"}
{"id":"31754671-233c-443c-b228-eeee37e4c155","expr":"owner.indexOf('/') >= 0","rationale":"Internal class names in ASM use slashes instead of dots, so the 'owner' string typically contains '/'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:40.223444647Z"}
{"id":"8079d0a5-e086-488f-8b49-d181d7929e01","expr":"name == null || (name.indexOf('<') == -1 && name.indexOf('>') == -1)","rationale":"The method name typically does not contain characters used in class generic signatures or special methods.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:40.223444647Z"}
{"id":"746fbee2-f760-419f-b68d-5eb42eea824d","expr":"attribute != null","rationale":"Since visitAttribute uses 'attribute' as input, it is reasonable that at method exit 'attribute' remains non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:42.633454925Z"}
{"id":"046320f3-72a3-44dd-90af-3ef7eb77c8a3","expr":"attribute.isCodeAttribute() == false","rationale":"Attributes passed to this method usually represent non-code, non-standard attributes, implying isCodeAttribute() likely returns false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:42.633454925Z"}
{"id":"761230d9-a2dd-4d52-8176-81225375eb06","expr":"!attribute.isUnknown() || attribute.isCodeAttribute()","rationale":"This captures a relationship between attribute states likely valid here.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:42.633454925Z"}
{"id":"221de863-e8b2-4643-ab1d-39a4c67c66ce","expr":"attribute.isUnknown() == !attribute.isCodeAttribute()","rationale":"This asserts a complementary relationship between unknown and code attribute status at this point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:42.633454925Z"}
{"id":"1d22881c-331b-4a29-bbdb-a7b69b9e3dc1","expr":"nestMember != null","rationale":"The method parameter nestMember should be non-null as it represents the internal name of a nest member class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:42.850431857Z"}
{"id":"d22756ac-f23a-4678-9424-688d3648afd9","expr":"!nestMember.isEmpty()","rationale":"The internal name of a class (nestMember) must be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:42.850431857Z"}
{"id":"a1b494f0-110d-4477-b676-a9a38bde1f68","expr":"!nestMember.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Internal names of classes do not contain spaces, so nestMember should not contain space characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:42.850431857Z"}
{"id":"4fac9367-bbc2-4c42-b3bc-58d02689df07","expr":"nestMember != null","rationale":"The method is expected to be called with a valid nest member name, so nestMember should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:43.143718358Z"}
{"id":"36819f8f-3e98-4f7a-9f4c-ffba697282b2","expr":"nestMember.length() > 0","rationale":"The nest member name should be a non-empty string representing an internal name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:43.143718358Z"}
{"id":"fa99e4ee-c65e-4212-95e1-900fe7995053","expr":"nestMember.indexOf('/') >= 0","rationale":"Internal names typically contain slashes as package/class separators.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:43.143718358Z"}
{"id":"042d3ec3-59cf-4ae5-a14a-7f298348ba7b","expr":"Character.isJavaIdentifierStart(nestMember.charAt(nestMember.lastIndexOf('/') + 1))","rationale":"The last segment of the internal name should start with a valid Java identifier start character.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:43.143718358Z"}
{"id":"a461fd67-7201-409e-bd46-d34554720a8f","expr":"nestMember.equals(nestMember.trim())","rationale":"The nest member name should not have leading or trailing whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:43.143718358Z"}
{"id":"fcf9ada3-e3a1-43b9-9070-e87a159e5108","expr":"permittedSubclass != null","rationale":"The permittedSubclass parameter represents the internal name of an allowed subclass; it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:43.944610990Z"}
{"id":"fce9e7d5-7b47-4cda-81af-227d8e6313fd","expr":"!permittedSubclass.isEmpty()","rationale":"The permittedSubclass should be a valid internal name, which is typically non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:43.944610990Z"}
{"id":"ce9a6365-4a86-473c-83be-d2fec274d233","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The visitInnerClass method requires the name parameter as the internal name of the class; it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:44.383726702Z"}
{"id":"270e1485-d7c5-4e71-8612-da554f18f3db","expr":"(outerName == null) || (!outerName.isEmpty())","rationale":"OuterName is null if the class is not a member; otherwise, it should be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:44.383726702Z"}
{"id":"0fa5e9a3-84a3-4182-bc12-9079989d2be4","expr":"(innerName == null) || (!innerName.isEmpty())","rationale":"InnerName is null for anonymous inner classes; otherwise, it should be a non-empty simple name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:44.383726702Z"}
{"id":"3f29ebab-d0f0-4bfc-a487-94bad02431d6","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access flags represent modifiers and should be non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:44.383726702Z"}
{"id":"b8d528b3-605d-4050-a125-fda559bc536f","expr":"name.startsWith(\"[\") || !name.contains(\"\\0\")","rationale":"Name is an internal name and shouldn't contain invalid characters such as null character.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:44.383726702Z"}
{"id":"960e1ce0-0796-4b11-b439-0c3722bc8ce2","expr":"attribute != null","rationale":"The attribute parameter passed to visitAttribute is expected to be non-null when this method is called.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:45.972835503Z"}
{"id":"52771c33-5be4-49ac-8569-d03527044b2b","expr":"attribute.isUnknown() == false","rationale":"Typically, a visitor processes known attributes; although this depends on usage, assuming attributes are recognized.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:45.972835503Z"}
{"id":"a4ea3552-5cdf-411c-8a53-703baa05f217","expr":"attribute.type != null","rationale":"An Attribute object commonly has a type field representing the attribute name or identifier which must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:45.972835503Z"}
{"id":"9dceb778-488a-44b4-9a63-32a94f1ab0d1","expr":"attribute.isCodeAttribute() == false","rationale":"Assuming attributes visited here are non-code attributes; not necessarily true but can be an example.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:45.972835503Z"}
{"id":"385a68c5-d128-4b44-ba37-daa861f37bdf","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method is expected to visit a record component with a valid name, which should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitRecordComponent(String,String,String):RecordComponentVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:46.706216968Z"}
{"id":"f99a6720-d941-4ba9-abc0-e95f381c060d","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"Descriptor of a record component is essential and should be non-null to describe the component type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitRecordComponent(String,String,String):RecordComponentVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:46.706216968Z"}
{"id":"40f7d1c1-a995-4d60-b2ed-ed432ca31788","expr":"signature == null || signature.length() >= 0","rationale":"Signature may be null if the record component is non-generic, otherwise it is a String.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitRecordComponent(String,String,String):RecordComponentVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:46.706216968Z"}
{"id":"9767acc9-09a9-4ecb-82bd-8d9943bde591","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"Typically, record component name should be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitRecordComponent(String,String,String):RecordComponentVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:46.706216968Z"}
{"id":"2639201e-3b67-466a-9ae1-0c29ed03f238","expr":"descriptor.startsWith(\"(\") == false","rationale":"Descriptor is expected to be a field descriptor, which does not start with '(' unlike method descriptors.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitRecordComponent(String,String,String):RecordComponentVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:46.706216968Z"}
{"id":"2ab0b1d8-16b7-40a4-8a6c-8341c8d24973","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The 'name' parameter is the internal name of the class being visited and should typically be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:48.492947989Z"}
{"id":"b0859c8d-1050-4b30-8324-5a0b1d920e25","expr":"innerName == null || !innerName.isEmpty()","rationale":"innerName is either null for anonymous classes or is a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:48.492947989Z"}
{"id":"ccd40830-cd19-4ee6-9666-99c7467f436c","expr":"(outerName == null) || (name.startsWith(outerName + \"$\"))","rationale":"If outerName is given, the 'name' string should generally start with 'outerName' + '$' to indicate the nested relationship.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:48.492947989Z"}
{"id":"d989d47b-b02a-4930-bc75-d559cc648e00","expr":"(innerName == null) || (innerName.equals(name.substring(name.lastIndexOf('$') + 1)))","rationale":"If innerName is available, it should correspond to the part of 'name' after the last '$' character.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:48.492947989Z"}
{"id":"0bc10ccc-f703-42a4-8173-55cd118fcbd4","expr":"(access & 0x20000) == 0 || (access & 0x40000) == 0","rationale":"While somewhat implementation dependent, access flags related to synthetic or deprecated states should be mutually consistent.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:48.492947989Z"}
{"id":"e42a9788-8659-4005-a563-18f60fb34562","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Field names in Java bytecode must be non-null strings representing the field identifier.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:48.759838308Z"}
{"id":"5a0bc556-acbe-4115-8b62-30fabf66a3c5","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The field's descriptor describes the field type, which is mandatory.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:48.759838308Z"}
{"id":"01c9b508-4d3b-41fd-ad5a-31df1df8a06c","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access is a flags bitmask indicating field properties, non-negative by nature of bitmask.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:48.759838308Z"}
{"id":"2522a500-8dbf-4283-991e-b6f6673e94cc","expr":"result == null || (name != null && descriptor != null)","rationale":"If result is non-null, likely name and descriptor are non-null as they describe the component visited.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitRecordComponent(String,String,String):RecordComponentVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:49.017089512Z"}
{"id":"870bc01c-c70d-4859-96e7-b50125737e55","expr":"result == null || !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"A record component name should not be empty if the component is visited.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitRecordComponent(String,String,String):RecordComponentVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:49.017089512Z"}
{"id":"3e6e27f0-b240-41ab-9e75-23ca02f84bbd","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method name should be a valid non-null string representing the method's name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:49.090640376Z"}
{"id":"71feb3bd-02e2-4ca0-8056-65197f72eaf3","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The descriptor defines the method signature, which must be present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:49.090640376Z"}
{"id":"06a8b2ab-9eb7-4593-9c56-5d3173e8d9a6","expr":"exceptions == null || exceptions.length >= 0","rationale":"Exceptions can be null or a non-null array; length must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:49.090640376Z"}
{"id":"f0ba8577-b3d1-4c62-85ee-c816785145dd","expr":"signature == null || signature.length() >= 0","rationale":"The signature is optional but if present is a string with non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:49.090640376Z"}
{"id":"ecde7399-db8b-4084-a2cf-fd61c5e4487a","expr":"permittedSubclass != null && !permittedSubclass.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method deals with permitted subclass names which should be valid internal names, thus not empty or null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:50.417055099Z"}
{"id":"e4dca14f-f824-4cee-ae65-98f8720d99c8","expr":"permittedSubclass != null && permittedSubclass.equals(permittedSubclass.trim())","rationale":"Internal names as class names are expected to not have unexpected leading or trailing whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:50.417055099Z"}
{"id":"ce180fbf-bb95-4060-8445-eec46fb079a8","expr":"permittedSubclass != null && !permittedSubclass.contains(\" \")","rationale":"A valid Java internal class name should not contain spaces.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:50.417055099Z"}
{"id":"2b4b6fb1-a23a-4749-b9e3-1a9cf12bd192","expr":"permittedSubclass != null && permittedSubclass.indexOf('/') >= 0","rationale":"Java internal names typically use slashes to separate package components.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:50.417055099Z"}
{"id":"32273835-8265-45ff-bcaa-29e73dfbc67e","expr":"permittedSubclass != null && permittedSubclass.length() > 0 && Character.isJavaIdentifierStart(permittedSubclass.charAt(permittedSubclass.length() - 1))","rationale":"Internal class names should end with a valid identifier character.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:50.417055099Z"}
{"id":"adaa2c82-d84e-4f0e-bd11-fbae2a1ef454","expr":"typeDescriptor != null","rationale":"The typeDescriptor must not be null since it is used to extract its length and content.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:51.983104443Z"}
{"id":"16ba7553-befd-404d-8276-0460a1f26c0a","expr":"typeDescriptor.length() > 0","rationale":"A valid type descriptor should have a positive length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:51.983104443Z"}
{"id":"809b5ce1-8e4b-43ff-b31b-c1d68edcfb57","expr":"typeDescriptor.equals(typeDescriptor.trim())","rationale":"Type descriptors typically do not contain leading or trailing whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:51.983104443Z"}
{"id":"e309fbfc-70b1-445b-b8a6-02f2e2bf2919","expr":"typeDescriptor.contains(\"(\") == typeDescriptor.contains(\")\")","rationale":"Method type descriptors have balanced parentheses that wrap argument types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:51.983104443Z"}
{"id":"6b24c068-b3eb-47ea-bca0-72ed59df5881","expr":"!clazz.isPrimitive() || result != null","rationale":"Result is non-null for non-primitive clazz, as getType returns a valid Type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Class<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:53.005301980Z"}
{"id":"e614a78f-84fb-4c61-93bc-9ecf6820e24c","expr":"!clazz.isPrimitive() || result.getSort() != -1","rationale":"If clazz is primitive, result's sort reflects the primitive type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Class<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:53.005301980Z"}
{"id":"796d6d06-fc6c-43d8-8517-02f7450a4381","expr":"result != null","rationale":"getType returns a Type instance, not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:53.346192160Z"}
{"id":"70fe737c-605d-4050-ba59-f7b2f5218a6f","expr":"result.toString().equals(typeDescriptor)","rationale":"The string representation of the returned Type should equal the input descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:53.346192160Z"}
{"id":"9fd6cf7a-d4c4-4a14-a94e-e5574fac188c","expr":"result.getDescriptor().equals(typeDescriptor)","rationale":"The descriptor of the returned Type should be the typeDescriptor string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:53.346192160Z"}
{"id":"deafd60b-08d5-4379-a691-352fd4d338c7","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method operates on a Class object to return its Type; null clazz would not be meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Class<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:29:53.471173968Z"}
