{"id":"a8557456-bd55-4bb6-ba5a-3587b19902c9","expr":"parameterCount == 0 || visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"No direct constraint between parameterCount and visible at method exit; visible is boolean.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAnnotableParameterCount(int,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:50.651527210Z"}
