{"id":"fed695d4-e05b-4f95-86c2-c7ac831882c9","expr":"attribute != null","rationale":"The attribute parameter should not be null when visiting, ensuring the method receives a valid attribute.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:53.161139360Z"}
{"id":"8d0ecc1a-97f8-49d8-8934-656ddc0b5e7c","expr":"!attribute.isCodeAttribute()","rationale":"Assuming a method to check if attribute is a code attribute; visitAttribute must be called before visitCode for non-code attributes, meaning attribute is typically not a code attribute at the method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:53.161139360Z"}
{"id":"b49f65d9-d5ec-4573-aaa9-edc1139cf55d","expr":"attribute.type != null","rationale":"Attributes typically have a non-null type field identifying their kind.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:53.161139360Z"}
{"id":"b8df5884-9574-4209-bcde-1aafb9455a41","expr":"attribute.isUnknown() || attribute.isKnown()","rationale":"The attribute may be categorized either as known or unknown attribute types, so one of these predicates should hold if these methods exist.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:53.161139360Z"}
