{"id":"1a9aa1e4-5382-4210-be84-530099f2f675","expr":"(local == null) == (numLocal == 0)","rationale":"If local variables exist, the local array should not be null; if there are no locals, local can be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:54.280332644Z"}
{"id":"87936d1c-2067-4a50-9d2b-9b4f97ae3b50","expr":"(stack == null) == (numStack == 0)","rationale":"If stack elements exist, the stack array should not be null; if stack count is zero, stack can be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:54.280332644Z"}
