{"id":"a3733a63-6542-472d-abda-93471ae74754","expr":"packaze != null","rationale":"The method parameter packaze is likely expected to be non-null for a meaningful call to visitPackage.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ModuleVisitor#visitPackage(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ModuleVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:54.501950367Z"}
{"id":"908aef62-34fd-4871-a181-6f17c70ffab8","expr":"packaze.indexOf('/') < 0","rationale":"Java internal names for packages usually do not contain slashes like '/', so this is likely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ModuleVisitor#visitPackage(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ModuleVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:54.501950367Z"}
{"id":"8f26e6ae-7c7d-4a72-9d1d-face894674ae","expr":"packaze.length() > 0","rationale":"A valid package name should not be empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ModuleVisitor#visitPackage(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ModuleVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:54.501950367Z"}
{"id":"5d88526b-d928-4149-ace2-4c443841706d","expr":"!packaze.trim().isEmpty()","rationale":"A meaningful package name should not be just whitespace characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ModuleVisitor#visitPackage(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ModuleVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:54.501950367Z"}
{"id":"7b46ecf2-6ef5-4236-a2c4-806a6ac8a443","expr":"packaze.equals(packaze.trim())","rationale":"Package names typically do not contain leading or trailing whitespace for correctness.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ModuleVisitor#visitPackage(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ModuleVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:54.501950367Z"}
{"id":"ad967f7d-6007-4bc6-a681-3ba6d4e95f53","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode should be non-negative as JVM opcodes are non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:56.185242926Z"}
{"id":"698bd5c5-c21d-4c6e-a4bb-b4ca664f5540","expr":"opcode <= 202","rationale":"Opcode values are limited to the defined JVM instruction range (current max known opcode is 202 in ASM).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:56.185242926Z"}
