{"id":"6e02d816-6687-4ecd-9129-60bb5e5d611c","expr":"opcode != 0 || true","rationale":"This is an always true expression and should not appear. Removed in final.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:56.185242926Z"}
