{"id":"1777fecb-68aa-402b-9069-84ad4c5168be","expr":"opcode == 0 || opcode == 1 || opcode == 46 || opcode == 177 || (opcode >= 172 && opcode <= 191)","rationale":"Certain opcodes like NOP (0), ACONST_NULL (1), IRETURN (172), RETURN (177), etc. are valid instructions to be visited.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:57.977745870Z"}
