{"id":"273c25e4-7bb0-4341-840a-fb81b6878235","expr":"opcode != -1","rationale":"Opcode should not be negative except possibly -1 which is not a valid opcode here.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:57.977745870Z"}
{"id":"a6a6e7b3-8cf3-44cd-ab82-ccfaef47d532","expr":"opcode >= 21 && opcode <= 169","rationale":"visitVarInsn handles opcodes for loading/storing local variables, which are in the range 21 (ILOAD) to 169 (RET).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:59.810675136Z"}
