{"id":"debff631-1b32-45a2-a602-eb791a073169","expr":"opcode == 16 || opcode == 17 || opcode == 188","rationale":"visitIntInsn only accepts opcodes that correspond to BIPUSH, SIPUSH, or NEWARRAY instructions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIntInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:36:59.990025445Z"}
