{"id":"89cbb49b-eb57-4922-8081-c2e3bcd41dc7","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The 'type' parameter represents an internal class name and must be non-null as per JVM bytecode semantics.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:07.142889443Z"}
