{"id":"a704fb3b-9ff8-431b-8a0b-78b7f3d148d2","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"Owner string must be non-null to represent the internal name of the class owning the method being visited.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:07.836691141Z"}
