{"id":"4e642f0c-b4bb-4f96-a6f0-4e5ac41169d0","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The 'owner' string representing the internal class name of the method owner is expected non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:14.120335893Z"}
{"id":"3a9de719-f245-4265-a736-af17ae6aa332","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Method name must be non-null to identify the called method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:14.120335893Z"}
{"id":"2968d617-d4fa-4697-84ec-dcab3b6cae40","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"Descriptor representing the method signature must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:14.120335893Z"}
{"id":"ae8ba00f-bc2d-481a-850c-fd2928175607","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The label parameter is used as target for the jump instruction, it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:14.673870419Z"}
