{"id":"ea5fe4ae-b23a-45ab-8104-22f588475c64","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The 'name' parameter represents the name of the invoked method and should be non-null as it is required to identify the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:16.109161754Z"}
