{"id":"086be69f-bb7d-477f-bab1-37e3a8b92679","expr":"bootstrapMethodArguments == null || bootstrapMethodArguments.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"The 'bootstrapMethodArguments' parameter is defined as an Object that may be null or an array of objects representing the bootstrap arguments.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:16.109161754Z"}
{"id":"a7801773-660e-4211-b427-acec3dff16fe","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"The 'name' parameter is expected to be a valid method name string of length greater than zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:16.109161754Z"}
{"id":"97c70e97-d72c-40d9-b051-f308335c6c37","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The descriptor parameter is expected to be a valid class descriptor string, so it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:17.496123149Z"}
{"id":"18e8696f-fa15-440d-8942-bd5986b37215","expr":"!descriptor.isEmpty()","rationale":"Describes the assumption that descriptor should not be an empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:17.496123149Z"}
{"id":"d9decbb3-fb2a-4ac8-8911-773cdc8f56b5","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"The 'visible' parameter is a boolean and can only hold these two values.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:17.496123149Z"}
{"id":"efdb5626-d67b-40ad-8c29-e4f10eb20be8","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The visitLabel method is called with label, so label is expected to be non-null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:18.528838569Z"}
{"id":"c5f1b292-0f90-48ce-b4d4-2f229dec5be8","expr":"label.equals(label)","rationale":"Label instance should be equal to itself, ensuring consistency.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:18.528838569Z"}
{"id":"831e4903-efa5-44f4-8f3f-364604d2a2ca","expr":"value != null","rationale":"Basic precondition that value is non-null before method execution.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:20.650197103Z"}
{"id":"a58efaee-f2b6-4b5f-aa38-721796734f0f","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode represents a Java bytecode instruction and is expected to be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:20.738349598Z"}
