{"id":"8820ae76-5d30-446d-b255-9ec19bd7e190","expr":"min <= max","rationale":"The method describes a table switch instruction which requires a valid range from min to max.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:23.737551745Z"}
{"id":"50346d06-06e8-4cae-ad9d-73db8d1cd2ba","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"The varargs labels parameter is expected to be non-null for valid table switch instruction targets.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:23.737551745Z"}
{"id":"eeb1c5ac-39a2-4497-a43a-dfa365487c8b","expr":"labels.length == (max - min + 1)","rationale":"Each key from min to max inclusive must have a corresponding label in the labels array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:23.737551745Z"}
{"id":"9f5bbcc4-10f5-4a63-9629-93e15f11ac13","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"The table switch instruction requires a default label to handle keys outside the range.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:23.737551745Z"}
{"id":"dbe81e93-8e73-42ff-abd6-7670040293e3","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"Default label must be non-null to serve as fallback target.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:24.419394739Z"}
{"id":"057bb826-da0b-46da-a2df-2399c2d968a7","expr":"keys != null","rationale":"Keys array is required for lookup switch indexing.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:24.419394739Z"}
{"id":"e5dbfaf0-5bb7-4778-9586-06bfa3bc497b","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"Labels array holds jump targets and must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:24.419394739Z"}
{"id":"b62bc9df-c733-4e73-9013-fe364c6b5e87","expr":"keys.length == labels.length","rationale":"Keys and labels arrays must be of the same length because each key maps to a label.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:24.419394739Z"}
{"id":"c7bb9e53-1230-4ce9-ac98-04f1138f5d9d","expr":"keys != null","rationale":"keys array is required for lookup switch keys","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:25.467586220Z"}
{"id":"009e4c4f-d07b-448d-bf2f-c78580bfb9ab","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"labels array corresponds to keys for case targets","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:25.467586220Z"}
{"id":"2b95087f-6d1f-43f4-a28c-8b5456d5aff5","expr":"keys.length == labels.length","rationale":"each key has exactly one corresponding label","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:25.467586220Z"}
{"id":"b1148041-9aa1-42fc-bafd-59ef691b08d6","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"default label must exist for the default branch","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:25.467586220Z"}
{"id":"a3ee410c-1fd8-403c-96e5-1a0d1d617d24","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The descriptor is presumably non-null since it is delegated to mv.visitMultiANewArrayInsn without null check.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:26.895705567Z"}
