{"id":"19642306-f27a-483c-97c2-7695a13d6f5f","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The descriptor string for the annotation class is usually required and non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:27.208116404Z"}
{"id":"98d0289e-ada3-469d-b55d-84d2dad4bb25","expr":"typePath == null || typePath.isEmpty() == false","rationale":"If typePath is not null, it usually represents a non-empty path.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:27.208116404Z"}
{"id":"b964df83-35b3-4e40-99eb-2ed1eff40e87","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"The boolean parameter visible is either true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:27.208116404Z"}
{"id":"4e808350-c33a-4ac7-b698-dcf4aa430538","expr":"typeRef >= 0","rationale":"Type references are generally non-negative integer constants.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:27.208116404Z"}
{"id":"a86c8f4e-442b-43b1-8373-8b90955a1181","expr":"min <= max","rationale":"In a tableswitch instruction, the min key must be less than or equal to max key as the range includes all keys between min and max.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:27.632925466Z"}
{"id":"8ccb60b5-574f-4cc9-ad10-17549cdd6a58","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"The tableswitch instruction must have a non-null labels array representing jump labels for each key from min to max.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:27.632925466Z"}
{"id":"b2e904dd-0167-4765-b2e2-c700d45faaac","expr":"labels.length == max - min + 1","rationale":"The tableswitch instruction requires a label for each key in the range [min, max], so labels length equals max - min + 1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:27.632925466Z"}
{"id":"943c6204-c315-407a-8b63-722662cc0771","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"The default label in a tableswitch instruction is mandatory and represents the jump target for any key that does not match the cases.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:27.632925466Z"}
{"id":"4e088eb8-c75e-47ca-8ff8-ae972db73517","expr":"start != null","rationale":"The 'start' label should be non-null as it marks the beginning of the try block.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:31.103881022Z"}
{"id":"811a509a-c0e8-4b39-87e7-cddc194d66f5","expr":"end != null","rationale":"The 'end' label marks the exclusive end of the try block and must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:31.103881022Z"}
{"id":"49fda66a-94be-4665-b6f1-b250fc844ef8","expr":"handler != null","rationale":"The 'handler' label marks the beginning of the exception handler and must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:31.103881022Z"}
{"id":"d397a973-958c-4f2a-b5de-4b04b3d3ebae","expr":"(type == null) || (type.length() > 0)","rationale":"The 'type' may be null to catch all exceptions (finally block), or if non-null must be non-empty string indicating the exception type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:31.103881022Z"}
{"id":"af601399-5439-472c-9b16-547d132a94ae","expr":"start != end","rationale":"The start and end labels define a range of bytecode instructions; they should not be equal.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:31.103881022Z"}
{"id":"7d2b28b7-2af2-405f-9e1b-2f5eeb2cb8b3","expr":"start != null && end != null && handler != null","rationale":"VisitTryCatchBlock requires non-null labels to define the scope and handler.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:31.286166505Z"}
{"id":"65340c1f-b460-4ed0-b79f-bf1595f8809f","expr":"start != end","rationale":"A valid try-catch block has a non-zero instruction range between start and end.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:31.286166505Z"}
{"id":"514663f8-b4e4-4c2b-8511-28b083d0787e","expr":"type == null || type.length() > 0","rationale":"The 'type' of caught exceptions is either null or a proper internal name string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:31.286166505Z"}
{"id":"ec1c463e-6495-4fae-bace-a7c51393464d","expr":"handler != start && handler != end","rationale":"Handler label usually distinct from try block boundaries.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:31.286166505Z"}
{"id":"6e23bad2-3699-4330-b981-1bef97f96167","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The descriptor string for an annotation should be non-null as it identifies the annotation type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:31.652117844Z"}
{"id":"d96ac4a3-719e-4c7d-9209-187c8002c0f9","expr":"(typePath == null || typePath.getLength() >= 0)","rationale":"If typePath is non-null, its length must be zero or positive indicating a valid path.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:31.652117844Z"}
{"id":"c04aa365-2c41-4cb6-a3a2-3c12f0475cc9","expr":"typeRef != 0","rationale":"typeRef identifies the annotated type and should be a valid non-zero type reference.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:31.652117844Z"}
{"id":"bca23279-95c8-4af1-bcdf-35fbd9eaadd9","expr":"descriptor.length() > 0","rationale":"A descriptor string for an annotation should not be empty as it identifies the annotation class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:31.652117844Z"}
{"id":"cda5caf6-c7e5-4eeb-9b89-0190d687893f","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"The visible parameter is a boolean indicating runtime visibility of the annotation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:31.652117844Z"}
{"id":"e39616d0-045b-4d61-81ca-f49fb5fe4026","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The local variable name must be a valid non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:32.898906669Z"}
{"id":"e2233a3d-5d15-4780-9ade-ef3eeebf3a32","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The descriptor of a local variable must not be null, as it represents the type descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:32.898906669Z"}
{"id":"b236c3a5-2794-4b65-a710-449c4a5c27c0","expr":"(signature == null || signature.length() > 0)","rationale":"The signature may be null or a non-empty string representing the generic signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:32.898906669Z"}
{"id":"ca08e610-4027-4daf-9e51-758bb864a486","expr":"start != null","rationale":"The start label of a local variable's scope cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:32.898906669Z"}
{"id":"f2efd751-70a0-4a24-b6de-edbd26fecf18","expr":"end != null","rationale":"The end label of a local variable's scope cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:32.898906669Z"}
{"id":"314161c7-dce9-44c2-87af-09de9565575a","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"descriptor specifies the array type, so it must be non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:33.002326205Z"}
{"id":"33b3be48-6746-4ae0-a52d-f5dce5ff2c2c","expr":"numDimensions >= 1","rationale":"numDimensions represents the number of dimensions of the array, at least 1","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:33.002326205Z"}
{"id":"6b55fb0e-1027-4d7b-8099-e73b7397a0e7","expr":"numDimensions <= descriptor.length()","rationale":"numDimensions should not exceed the descriptor length (a rough limit)","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:33.002326205Z"}
{"id":"4120897b-d30b-4de3-bd66-d865d95c6455","expr":"descriptor.startsWith(\"[\")","rationale":"The descriptor for array types must start with '['","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:33.002326205Z"}
{"id":"6475a41c-826f-48f0-b1c2-7d228447b606","expr":"value != null","rationale":"The method should only throw for certain special ASM versions and input types, so when the method completes, the value is an instance of a valid constant type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:33.545505827Z"}
{"id":"f487d5a7-0410-49d8-8ba3-197660773cd0","expr":"(result == null) || (result != null && descriptor != null && descriptor.equals(descriptor))","rationale":"The visitTryCatchAnnotation method returns the result of mv.visitTryCatchAnnotation if mv is not null, else null. The result is either null or a valid AnnotationVisitor related to the given descriptor which should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:33.613701685Z"}
{"id":"15e0670e-8bf7-4529-95cc-8fb73b51a4b2","expr":"typePath == null || (result != null)","rationale":"Because the method forwards the call to mv.visitTryCatchAnnotation if mv is non-null, and typePath is an input parameter to that call, the presence of typePath influences but does not prohibit result from being non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:33.613701685Z"}
{"id":"1e45e8bc-392c-4a09-a29e-05fc0caaa9cc","expr":"line > 0","rationale":"In Java bytecode, line numbers represent actual source lines and are positive integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:34.579064003Z"}
{"id":"119789cc-76cc-4fe6-946c-c908bb4dda97","expr":"start != null","rationale":"The start label parameter must be a non-null Label instance indicating the bytecode instruction offset.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:34.579064003Z"}
{"id":"b0d2ce61-3a03-4188-9bb5-35bf88a52d5b","expr":"maxStack >= 0","rationale":"The maximum stack size must be non-negative as it represents a size/count.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:35.016266294Z"}
{"id":"1385805b-89cd-41cf-a7f0-7e96c59431e2","expr":"maxLocals >= 0","rationale":"The maximum number of local variables cannot be negative since it represents a count.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:35.016266294Z"}
{"id":"0807f521-34ac-496b-bbd4-8716cd996ee0","expr":"typePath == null || typePath.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"TypePath may be null, or if not, its length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLocalVariableAnnotation(int,TypePath,Label[],Label[],int[],String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:36.284430503Z"}
{"id":"37caaf7f-4cda-454d-a832-9240b4a3b3f5","expr":"start != null","rationale":"Start labels array must be non-null for meaningful annotation ranges.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLocalVariableAnnotation(int,TypePath,Label[],Label[],int[],String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:36.284430503Z"}
{"id":"c88187d2-1851-4ccd-9cbd-e3759e37e8ce","expr":"end != null","rationale":"End labels array must be non-null and should correspond in size to start array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLocalVariableAnnotation(int,TypePath,Label[],Label[],int[],String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:36.284430503Z"}
{"id":"4f76e977-03d6-4a7c-bea3-1aafaf3058e9","expr":"start.length == end.length","rationale":"Start and end label arrays must have the same length to represent annotation scopes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLocalVariableAnnotation(int,TypePath,Label[],Label[],int[],String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:36.284430503Z"}
{"id":"49ea4a3e-2650-4a81-831a-2e8982b09565","expr":"index.length == start.length","rationale":"Index array size should match start (and end) array size.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLocalVariableAnnotation(int,TypePath,Label[],Label[],int[],String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:36.284430503Z"}
{"id":"bb8fcc9e-1a81-4d74-828a-b2b6766a6549","expr":"line > 0","rationale":"The 'line' parameter represents a source code line number which is positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:36.861198788Z"}
{"id":"24787d33-0c63-4841-a5d2-e3cdf745d71a","expr":"start != null","rationale":"'start' label is the first instruction corresponding to the line number and should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:36.861198788Z"}
{"id":"bc77a930-e586-4a8e-899a-a473f503da45","expr":"line != 0","rationale":"Source line number zero is typically invalid; lines start at 1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:36.861198788Z"}
{"id":"0b0c390c-e009-4a8d-9446-d09604cdc83e","expr":"maxStack >= 0","rationale":"maxStack being a stack size is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:37.367511893Z"}
{"id":"799c0ecb-2a27-469f-9d62-a905d48c0629","expr":"maxLocals >= 0","rationale":"maxLocals is the count of local variables, so it should be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:37.367511893Z"}
{"id":"1fa7c8d2-e719-40b6-bc72-5227addf1d5d","expr":"maxLocals <= 65535","rationale":"Java bytecode local variables maximum count is usually capped at 65535.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:37.367511893Z"}
{"id":"66d3802d-7837-423c-8ea0-aa026ddac6a3","expr":"maxStack <= 65535","rationale":"maxStack upper bound corresponds to JVM limits.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:37.367511893Z"}
{"id":"fe4fbf83-008e-46fd-8d6b-472441f920d7","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The name parameter represents the local variable's identifier and is generally non-null as it is required for meaningful variable tracking.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:37.543211662Z"}
{"id":"de99deae-3bd4-4688-937e-4421cb397c7a","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"Descriptor represents the type descriptor for the local variable, which should be non-null to indicate the variable's type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:37.543211662Z"}
{"id":"d71d1aa1-f33c-46e5-8705-7e00943f4422","expr":"(signature == null) || (signature.length() >= 0)","rationale":"Signature is optional and can be null; if non-null, it contains generic type information, so this invariant covers both cases.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:37.543211662Z"}
{"id":"6d21a48e-a1ec-446c-9419-0ba59e1cf45a","expr":"start != null && end != null","rationale":"The start and end parameters mark the lifetime scope of the local variable within the instruction list, so both should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:37.543211662Z"}
{"id":"cad81a45-8583-48da-824a-415656a46ddf","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"The index is the local variable's position in the local variable array and must be zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:37.543211662Z"}
{"id":"3f22e298-030c-4049-8062-cc17008b8b18","expr":"result >= 1 && result <= 9","rationale":"The tag returned by getTag must be within the set of defined opcode constants: H_GETFIELD (1), H_GETSTATIC (2), H_PUTFIELD (3), H_PUTSTATIC (4), H_INVOKEVIRTUAL (5), H_INVOKESTATIC (6), H_INVOKESPECIAL (7), H_NEWINVOKESPECIAL (8), or H_INVOKEINTERFACE (9). The numeric range 1 to 9 captures these.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handle#getTag():int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handle.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:40.638994403Z"}
{"id":"b23663cc-347b-4fac-9233-67e5feb3e78f","expr":"result != 0","rationale":"The tag must be one of the defined opcode constants which start from 1; zero is not a valid tag.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handle#getTag():int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handle.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:40.638994403Z"}
{"id":"64327258-be87-4ee5-9b15-b376753ac714","expr":"result != 10","rationale":"Ensures that the returned tag is not outside the known opcode constants.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handle#getTag():int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handle.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:40.638994403Z"}
{"id":"7d22b472-7891-4ddd-a611-158063a39609","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The getOwner() method returns the internal name of the class that owns the field or method, which should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handle#getOwner():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handle.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:40.938523400Z"}
{"id":"a6f0d20a-6596-424e-9868-c98d9f53c3f4","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"The internal name of a class is a non-empty, valid JVM internal name as per Type#getInternalName() contract.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handle#getOwner():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handle.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:40.938523400Z"}
{"id":"12069a8f-3b94-4ebd-8d46-ae45116a6d7c","expr":"!result.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Internal names typically do not contain spaces, as they are internal binary names.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handle#getOwner():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handle.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:40.938523400Z"}
{"id":"27b09cbd-136a-4aae-a269-50caef996f5d","expr":"!result.startsWith(\".\")","rationale":"Internal names represent class names in internal form and do not start with a dot character.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handle#getOwner():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handle.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:40.938523400Z"}
{"id":"a26a2d56-1bd8-4287-8bfa-ec94fa889696","expr":"result.equals(result.trim())","rationale":"The internal names do not contain leading or trailing whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handle#getOwner():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handle.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:40.938523400Z"}
{"id":"14a25d59-e42f-423e-8fd4-d4551221b5bd","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The getName() method returns the field 'name' which is expected to be a non-null string representing the name of the field or method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handle#getName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handle.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:42.328006781Z"}
{"id":"96b1db5f-842c-44b7-ab60-91bd00a9380e","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"The name returned by getName() should be a non-empty string as it represents a valid identifier.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handle#getName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handle.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:42.328006781Z"}
{"id":"c5cbb12e-4a12-4887-8401-b88fc730912e","expr":"result.equals(result.trim())","rationale":"Typically, names of fields or methods do not contain leading or trailing whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handle#getName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handle.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:42.328006781Z"}
{"id":"50aa871e-72f0-47e9-899e-b6dcf12bd966","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The descriptor string for a method or field should always be non-null to correctly represent the signature or type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handle#getDesc():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handle.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:43.966767823Z"}
{"id":"28b39d9f-6b47-4766-8717-11bc2af9c6ea","expr":"result.startsWith(\"(\") || !result.contains(\"(\")","rationale":"If this handle represents a method, the descriptor string should start with '('; if it is a field, it won't contain '(' character.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handle#getDesc():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handle.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:43.966767823Z"}
{"id":"1abded5a-8f9c-46eb-bfa9-2fb0827feb88","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"A valid field or method descriptor must have non-zero length describing the type signature.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handle#getDesc():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handle.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:43.966767823Z"}
{"id":"8fc2d055-f1d5-4309-a7ca-4c0b89207cc1","expr":"!result.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Descriptors in JVM bytecode format do not contain spaces; hence, the string should not contain space characters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handle#getDesc():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handle.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:43.966767823Z"}
{"id":"c757c6e7-8d0a-4cd9-8e92-df69efd647ae","expr":"object != null || object == null","rationale":"At method entry, object can be null or non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handle#equals(Object):boolean","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handle.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:45.539169372Z"}
{"id":"52df0d97-0fd4-4a50-866e-f9cb8c002011","expr":"!(result) || object != null","rationale":"The method requires a non-null object to be equal.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Handle#equals(Object):boolean","file":"org/springframework/asm/Handle.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:46.717254881Z"}
{"id":"8f3896c1-cc26-4022-847b-d7146a8db984","expr":"flags >= 0","rationale":"Flags parameter is typically a bitmask of options flags and expected to be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#hasFlags(int):boolean","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:48.093666204Z"}
{"id":"8bdecbe0-cde7-4a91-91f3-ae588fb61ef5","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The 'name' parameter is the internal class name and should be non-null as it is used to set thisClass.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:50.284115338Z"}
{"id":"b5da96e8-59b1-409e-8f31-0163816ebf2e","expr":"version >= 0","rationale":"The version is a non-negative int representing the class file version.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:50.284115338Z"}
{"id":"44e786d3-f077-4db7-9157-6f52c2ab972f","expr":"interfaces == null || interfaces.length >= 0","rationale":"Interfaces array is either null or has non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:50.284115338Z"}
{"id":"c780b46e-e8e0-4c9e-923c-851a0bfc3c14","expr":"superName == null || superName.length() > 0","rationale":"If superName is not null, it should be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:50.284115338Z"}
{"id":"799d92a0-85ea-478e-aa17-dfdfe6504151","expr":"signature == null || signature.length() > 0","rationale":"If signature is set, it is a meaningful class signature and not empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:50.284115338Z"}
{"id":"e490e011-49da-4233-842d-0f1667c344ee","expr":"file == null || file.length() >= 0","rationale":"File, if not null, must be a valid string with non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:52.039594873Z"}
{"id":"8e89714b-5639-4900-a6d2-ea6e235c04d1","expr":"debug == null || debug.length() >= 0","rationale":"Debug, if not null, must be a valid string with non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:52.039594873Z"}
{"id":"ca4448c9-cf9c-4b92-8d77-4b8322f9558a","expr":"file == null || debug != null || true","rationale":"No known mandatory relation between file and debug parameters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:52.039594873Z"}
{"id":"1bd7183b-8943-436b-9a17-4caf44cda632","expr":"file == null || !file.isEmpty() || true","rationale":"If file is not null, it's allowed to be empty or not.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:52.039594873Z"}
{"id":"e0237978-0835-466e-948d-bc803bf13b3c","expr":"debug == null || !debug.isEmpty() || true","rationale":"If debug is not null, it's allowed to be empty or not.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:52.039594873Z"}
{"id":"94125bb1-cfbd-48c6-8a78-43058ec09f19","expr":"(file == null || file.length() > 0)","rationale":"If the file string is non-null, it is expected to be a non-empty string since it's used as source file.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:37:53.182802749Z"}
