{"id":"a6e5986f-12ae-4198-8568-51cd38f7ed29","expr":"value != null","rationale":"Typically, the constant pool does not contain null constants, so value is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#newConst(Object):int","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:38:12.705707916Z"}
