{"id":"27de28c6-fbd6-4c91-aaee-9007a8daf287","expr":"!clazz.isArray()","rationale":"The method is intended to instantiate class types, not arrays.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.objenesis.SpringObjenesis#newInstance(Class<T>):T","file":"org/springframework/objenesis/SpringObjenesis.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T11:38:40.428978422Z"}
